1
00:00:04,340 --> 00:02:04,340
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries

2
00:02:04,450 --> 00:02:08,949
No living being was harmed during the
filming of this series.

3
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,740
Episode 108

4
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:13,690
"One day later"

5
00:02:13,885 --> 00:02:16,465
No one was hurt, right, Hatuns?

6
00:02:16,495 --> 00:02:19,825
The stone you are not afraid
of may harm you, my Bey.

7
00:02:21,315 --> 00:02:23,405
Alçiçek has an aide, my Bey.

8
00:02:23,425 --> 00:02:25,495
I locked the door on Bengi.

9
00:02:25,495 --> 00:02:27,355
So, we went out quietly and came.

10
00:02:28,695 --> 00:02:33,255
I swear Bengi Hatun was so angry.

11
00:02:46,445 --> 00:02:50,535
Alçiçek's aide is a good girl.

12
00:02:54,435 --> 00:02:56,195
What about you, my Bey?

13
00:02:56,215 --> 00:02:58,805
How did you get out of
all those spears?

14
00:02:59,685 --> 00:03:03,185
When we told them we had put
gunpowder around the castle...

15
00:03:03,615 --> 00:03:05,925
They had to leave us.

16
00:03:10,145 --> 00:03:12,215
No, does this make sense?

17
00:03:12,645 --> 00:03:14,815
It's ours, I ask Allah's forgiveness

18
00:03:15,115 --> 00:03:19,185
But the suspicion was
enough, was it not, my Bey?

19
00:03:19,745 --> 00:03:22,265
They must have understood
the truth after we left.

20
00:03:25,255 --> 00:03:28,825
However, Bengi will do something.

21
00:03:29,055 --> 00:03:32,065
So, we will take our
precautions accordingly.

22
00:03:32,295 --> 00:03:34,425
Take precautions.

23
00:03:35,005 --> 00:03:37,515
We are as promised about the wedding....

24
00:03:38,885 --> 00:03:41,275
We're going to get İnegöl.

25
00:03:41,645 --> 00:03:44,505
And we will have our
wedding in İnegöl, Inshallah.

26
00:03:47,525 --> 00:03:48,655
Boran.

27
00:03:48,655 --> 00:03:49,965
My Bey.

28
00:03:50,015 --> 00:03:52,535
If not by good, then by force.

29
00:03:52,535 --> 00:03:54,565
Tell the Alps to go there.

30
00:03:55,075 --> 00:03:58,645
And let them take the battering
ram and the siege weapons.

31
00:03:58,945 --> 00:04:00,535
Your command, my Bey.

32
00:04:02,375 --> 00:04:03,695
Come on.

33
00:04:05,195 --> 00:04:06,695
My Bey.

34
00:04:07,155 --> 00:04:09,185
Shall we fight Turgut Bey?

35
00:04:09,745 --> 00:04:11,775
We'll fight Turgut Bey first...

36
00:04:11,865 --> 00:04:13,935
But for our calling...

37
00:04:14,325 --> 00:04:18,105
If we have to, we will fight the whole
world as long as our breath suffices.

38
00:04:25,645 --> 00:04:26,985
Come on.

39
00:04:32,855 --> 00:04:34,915
Marmaracık Castle

40
00:04:36,275 --> 00:04:38,055
They will all see.

41
00:04:39,425 --> 00:04:44,465
They will all pay for kidnapping my woman.

42
00:04:45,015 --> 00:04:46,525
Bayındır.

43
00:04:47,705 --> 00:04:51,205
Weigh your words first, then speak.

44
00:04:51,965 --> 00:04:54,175
Alçiçek is not your woman.

45
00:04:54,585 --> 00:04:56,305
It's my daughter.

46
00:04:56,995 --> 00:04:58,705
She was going to be my woman.

47
00:04:59,425 --> 00:05:01,165
We were going to get married.

48
00:05:02,805 --> 00:05:06,595
Will you stand before me now
and defend Osman Bey?

49
00:05:06,695 --> 00:05:08,245
Bayındır Bey.

50
00:05:11,485 --> 00:05:13,985
Bayındır Bey is right, Öktem Bey.

51
00:05:14,295 --> 00:05:18,015
Osman Bey reached the limit by
kidnapping Alçiçek.

52
00:05:18,145 --> 00:05:21,575
It's time to drown them all.

53
00:05:23,085 --> 00:05:25,435
They didn't keep the promise made to me.

54
00:05:26,565 --> 00:05:28,625
You made that promise to me.

55
00:05:28,705 --> 00:05:30,765
They didn't listen to your words.

56
00:05:30,765 --> 00:05:32,545
And now we will not listen to them.

57
00:05:32,745 --> 00:05:34,555
This will not end like this.

58
00:05:34,585 --> 00:05:36,175
Enough, Bengi.

59
00:05:36,795 --> 00:05:38,165
Enough.

60
00:05:38,565 --> 00:05:40,885
Everything that happened
was because of you.

61
00:05:42,735 --> 00:05:45,005
As for you, Bayındır...

62
00:05:45,415 --> 00:05:46,985
I understand you.

63
00:05:47,335 --> 00:05:48,915
You are angry.

64
00:05:49,115 --> 00:05:50,435
I know.

65
00:05:50,475 --> 00:05:52,345
Your pride has been wounded.

66
00:05:53,065 --> 00:05:54,415
However...

67
00:05:55,645 --> 00:05:59,855
Alçiçek is not your woman, she
is my daughter.

68
00:06:00,595 --> 00:06:03,755
I am the one who does
what needs to be done.

69
00:06:05,325 --> 00:06:11,145
Don't ever try to charge
me again, Bayındır.

70
00:06:11,565 --> 00:06:14,935
I wouldn't mind our long
friendship, you know.

71
00:06:15,545 --> 00:06:19,185
You're just pissing us off.

72
00:06:19,905 --> 00:06:23,445
We were disgraced in front of Sultan.

73
00:06:23,935 --> 00:06:26,485
She couldn't stay in the castle
because of her anger.

74
00:06:26,555 --> 00:06:29,105
You, Öktem Bey...

75
00:06:29,295 --> 00:06:30,995
You couldn't keep your daughter.

76
00:06:31,095 --> 00:06:32,415
Bayındır.

77
00:06:35,925 --> 00:06:37,225
Aybars.

78
00:06:39,335 --> 00:06:42,105
Tell Alps to take their swords.

79
00:06:42,725 --> 00:06:44,595
We will go to Yenişehir.

80
00:06:54,435 --> 00:06:56,995
You're not coming, Bayındır.

81
00:06:58,355 --> 00:07:01,385
I'm going to take my daughter.

82
00:07:05,765 --> 00:07:07,615
No work for you there.

83
00:07:10,965 --> 00:07:12,735
Stay safe.

84
00:07:23,045 --> 00:07:24,905
So be it, Öktem Bey.

85
00:07:25,835 --> 00:07:27,355
So be it.

86
00:07:28,355 --> 00:07:29,885
Hüseyin.

87
00:07:31,935 --> 00:07:34,685
I was defeated before
my damned conscience.

88
00:07:36,595 --> 00:07:38,685
That dog, Aktemur.

89
00:07:39,235 --> 00:07:42,805
I should have killed him with my own hands
before handing him over to Olof.

90
00:07:43,405 --> 00:07:46,255
But better late than never.

91
00:07:46,985 --> 00:07:51,395
I'm going to rip that dog's heart
out with my own hands.

92
00:07:52,955 --> 00:07:54,495
Come on.

93
00:08:13,495 --> 00:08:15,075
I thought he left me.

94
00:08:17,345 --> 00:08:19,215
I thought he got scared and ran away.

95
00:08:22,245 --> 00:08:24,455
The truth is that they hurt him a lot.

96
00:08:30,875 --> 00:08:32,433
He was coming.

97
00:08:34,794 --> 00:08:36,683
Otherwise, he would have come.

98
00:08:38,775 --> 00:08:40,325
He would have come.

99
00:08:59,755 --> 00:09:01,275
Are they yours?

100
00:09:03,075 --> 00:09:05,095
They're a gift from Aktemur.

101
00:09:10,905 --> 00:09:12,225
Put them on.

102
00:09:41,635 --> 00:09:42,995
He woke up.

103
00:09:43,535 --> 00:09:44,845
He woke up.

104
00:09:46,075 --> 00:09:47,665
Son.

105
00:09:47,715 --> 00:09:50,545
Thank Allah.

106
00:09:51,785 --> 00:09:53,015
You woke up, right?

107
00:09:57,535 --> 00:09:59,725
Look who we brought to you.

108
00:10:18,585 --> 00:10:21,825
Your uncle kidnapped Alçiçek
from her wedding and brought her to you.

109
00:10:28,325 --> 00:10:29,855
Aktemur.

110
00:10:31,595 --> 00:10:33,445
You are fine, right?

111
00:10:34,025 --> 00:10:35,885
- Mother.
- Yes?

112
00:10:40,925 --> 00:10:41,805
Okay.

113
00:10:42,175 --> 00:10:43,765
You both speak.

114
00:10:45,125 --> 00:10:46,875
I'm at the door.

115
00:11:03,585 --> 00:11:06,345
İnegöl Castle

116
00:11:14,385 --> 00:11:16,415
What are you thinking, Turgut Bey?

117
00:11:18,375 --> 00:11:20,215
Are you afraid
for your property?

118
00:11:30,175 --> 00:11:32,185
We increased the number of Alps.

119
00:11:32,505 --> 00:11:34,335
And the archers were deployed.

120
00:11:34,805 --> 00:11:36,345
All precautions have been taken.

121
00:11:36,345 --> 00:11:37,665
Thank you.

122
00:11:40,035 --> 00:11:44,075
Wherever the Sultan is, the rule
of Beys is abolished.

123
00:11:44,435 --> 00:11:46,995
By increasing these measures...

124
00:11:47,335 --> 00:11:49,615
you're doing unnecessary work, Turgut Bey.

125
00:11:50,485 --> 00:11:53,055
If you knew Osman Bey
as well as I know him...

126
00:11:53,945 --> 00:11:57,385
You would have known that taking
measures is obligatory, Sultan.

127
00:11:57,605 --> 00:12:00,295
I know Osman Bey very well.

128
00:12:01,655 --> 00:12:04,035
But you do not know me.

129
00:12:09,015 --> 00:12:10,595
Archers!

130
00:12:25,535 --> 00:12:27,595
You will definitely take heed.

131
00:12:29,105 --> 00:12:34,175
For where words are not
enough, words are for the sword.

132
00:12:35,385 --> 00:12:38,675
However, I believe that precautions
must be taken despite everything.

133
00:12:38,845 --> 00:12:43,835
If Osman Bey considers his path to be the
right, then he won't listen to anyone.

134
00:12:43,985 --> 00:12:47,305
So, we will speak to him in the
language he understands.

135
00:12:48,335 --> 00:12:52,705
Osman Bey will die at
his slightest mistake.

136
00:12:53,385 --> 00:12:55,045
Let him go ahead and come.

137
00:14:00,405 --> 00:14:04,625
You come with a bang.

138
00:14:04,925 --> 00:14:06,235
No.

139
00:14:07,315 --> 00:14:09,355
My intention is good.

140
00:14:09,465 --> 00:14:15,275
You risked all your possessions and come to
take from Turgut Bey the castle he deserves.

141
00:14:16,885 --> 00:14:18,385
Is this your good intention?

142
00:14:18,525 --> 00:14:20,285
You are right.

143
00:14:21,625 --> 00:14:24,675
This castle belongs to Turgut Bey
as long as he deserves it.

144
00:14:26,045 --> 00:14:31,575
But he doesn't deserve it anymore.

145
00:14:35,365 --> 00:14:36,865
You are going
beyond your limits.

146
00:14:38,375 --> 00:14:40,685
You can't decide that.

147
00:14:44,135 --> 00:14:47,715
I've done a lot of things you said
I couldn't do, İsmihan Sultan.

148
00:14:57,945 --> 00:15:00,035
You will leave the castle now.

149
00:15:03,035 --> 00:15:11,605
The day when I set foot on these
lands, it was over for you.

150
00:15:38,465 --> 00:15:43,645
This is the decision of Sultan Aladdin,
the sole ruler of these lands.

151
00:15:44,715 --> 00:15:51,365
İnegöl Castle was granted to Turgut Bey
by this decree.

152
00:15:59,665 --> 00:16:03,385
Turgut Bey is not only the ruler of
İnegöl...

153
00:16:04,425 --> 00:16:07,125
but also the owner.

154
00:16:10,535 --> 00:16:12,605
İnegöl belongs to me.

155
00:16:15,065 --> 00:16:16,835
Why are you here*

156
00:16:18,325 --> 00:16:21,045
Let justice take its course, Osman Bey.

157
00:16:28,325 --> 00:16:29,905
Sultan.

158
00:16:33,565 --> 00:16:36,705
My brother fell a martyr for these lands.

159
00:16:39,655 --> 00:16:45,365
And I beheaded my greatest
enemy, Nicolas, on these lands.

160
00:16:48,455 --> 00:16:51,075
And I based my dream
many years ago on it.

161
00:16:53,255 --> 00:16:57,695
And I fought for it for many years.

162
00:17:05,233 --> 00:17:06,585
For this reason...

163
00:17:09,595 --> 00:17:12,545
You can't take it from me with
a piece of paper like that.

164
00:17:15,194 --> 00:17:17,723
Do you oppose the Sultan's order?

165
00:17:27,194 --> 00:17:28,765
Like I said...

166
00:17:32,315 --> 00:17:36,875
Neither words nor decisions convinced him.

167
00:17:39,915 --> 00:17:41,245
Soldiers!

168
00:18:03,335 --> 00:18:04,595
Now I ask you again...

169
00:18:06,635 --> 00:18:09,675
Do you oppose the Sultan's order?

170
00:18:12,955 --> 00:18:15,005
Can you risk something like that?

171
00:18:17,845 --> 00:18:22,115
You can't imagine what I would risk.

172
00:18:26,315 --> 00:18:31,355
And you can't expect what I can do.

173
00:18:35,715 --> 00:18:37,855
Don't confuse me with the others.

174
00:18:39,745 --> 00:18:42,315
I am not a Vizier
coming to you with an order.

175
00:18:43,745 --> 00:18:46,035
I am not a Mongol commander.

176
00:18:46,775 --> 00:18:48,645
I am İsmihan Sultan.

177
00:18:51,975 --> 00:18:53,775
Whoever you are...

178
00:18:55,785 --> 00:19:01,515
These lands which I have taken by shedding our blood,
I will not leave without shedding the blood of others.

179
00:19:05,175 --> 00:19:06,445
Is it?

180
00:19:08,635 --> 00:19:13,395
Looks like you're going to lose a lot of things
other than your blood, Osman Bey.

181
00:19:17,045 --> 00:19:18,785
We have a guest now.

182
00:19:19,625 --> 00:19:23,365
Kantakuzenos, the great procurator and
viceroy of the Emperor.

183
00:20:15,785 --> 00:20:17,125
Get away.

184
00:20:18,255 --> 00:20:21,115
Don't make me shed
blood brothers, go away.

185
00:20:26,785 --> 00:20:28,525
Alps!

186
00:20:30,795 --> 00:20:32,385
Lower your weapons.

187
00:20:36,925 --> 00:20:38,425
Alçiçek.

188
00:20:39,545 --> 00:20:42,615
Your mother and and father came, come on.

189
00:20:42,745 --> 00:20:44,505
Come on, Alçiçek.

190
00:20:44,545 --> 00:20:46,095
Bengi Hatun.

191
00:20:47,005 --> 00:20:51,815
You cannot summon
anyone to you like that in my palace.

192
00:20:52,475 --> 00:20:55,845
What does it mean that you kidnapped
my daughter on her wedding day, Malhun Hatun?

193
00:20:55,995 --> 00:20:58,505
What norms do you rule by?

194
00:21:00,575 --> 00:21:03,855
Öktem Bey, you are a reasonable man.

195
00:21:04,515 --> 00:21:07,565
And you know, Osman Bey
can't do that without a reason.

196
00:21:08,865 --> 00:21:12,495
Tell me, Bala Hatun,
is this the way it's done?

197
00:21:13,465 --> 00:21:16,705
My daughter told her mother
that she was going to marry Bayındır Bey.

198
00:21:16,925 --> 00:21:19,725
Is this how you
prevent it, Bala Hatun?

199
00:21:21,325 --> 00:21:27,395
Öktem Bey, someone seems to
have blinded your eyes to the truth.

200
00:21:28,025 --> 00:21:30,925
Aktemur and Alçiçek love each other.

201
00:21:36,315 --> 00:21:41,185
We know the origins, and we have sent
you news and come to your door.

202
00:21:41,615 --> 00:21:46,205
But you broke your promise
and we had to do it.

203
00:21:47,015 --> 00:21:51,585
Do you want your daughter to spend her
life with a man she doesn't love, Öktem Bey?

204
00:21:52,745 --> 00:21:57,245
Come on, put your weapons down
and let's work this out quietly.

205
00:21:57,575 --> 00:22:00,115
We will not listen to
you talk anymore.

206
00:22:00,475 --> 00:22:04,435
Alps, crush whoever stands
in front of you, come on.

207
00:22:04,785 --> 00:22:06,415
My mother.

208
00:22:11,265 --> 00:22:12,965
Alçiçek.

209
00:22:14,435 --> 00:22:15,815
My father.

210
00:22:19,195 --> 00:22:20,395
My daughter

211
00:22:23,705 --> 00:22:25,285
Come on, let's go from here.

212
00:22:39,965 --> 00:22:45,735
Osman Bey, as you can see,
we're here to represent both states.

213
00:22:51,785 --> 00:22:56,325
And your agreement
with us will benefit you.

214
00:22:57,685 --> 00:23:01,885
You didn't look so imposing as you
asking me for help, Kantakuzenos.

215
00:23:04,305 --> 00:23:06,745
It seems that the position
has benefited you a lot.

216
00:23:09,705 --> 00:23:12,595
What happened in the
past happened and ended.

217
00:23:13,035 --> 00:23:17,025
And now I am before you, and
we will make a pact together.

218
00:23:17,445 --> 00:23:18,805
Good.

219
00:23:19,595 --> 00:23:20,985
Good.

220
00:23:22,255 --> 00:23:25,675
But we build our future
by looking at our past.

221
00:23:26,875 --> 00:23:29,285
Be careful not to get
this out of your mind.

222
00:23:38,625 --> 00:23:40,435
Now what is this agreement?

223
00:23:41,895 --> 00:23:44,335
Let the Sultan clarify this if she wants.

224
00:23:48,555 --> 00:23:51,565
Here, Konya.

225
00:23:55,505 --> 00:23:58,355
And here, Constantinople.

226
00:24:01,935 --> 00:24:05,835
And you're right in the middle.

227
00:24:06,875 --> 00:24:12,075
That is, we hold the feet of this
table, and you are in the middle of it.

228
00:24:13,435 --> 00:24:15,525
We will now end this situation.

229
00:24:16,925 --> 00:24:20,615
Your presence harms
these lands, Osman Bey.

230
00:24:21,595 --> 00:24:25,775
If you have strength, you have gathered it
from these two countries.

231
00:24:26,125 --> 00:24:33,215
What you did brought nothing but
blood and tears to these lands.

232
00:24:36,625 --> 00:24:39,935
Are you the ones who will secure
reconciliation and peace on these lands?

233
00:24:44,585 --> 00:24:47,405
He only cares about the throne.

234
00:24:49,035 --> 00:24:50,735
And greed for power.

235
00:24:52,505 --> 00:24:53,505
And receiving judgment.

236
00:24:56,655 --> 00:24:58,915
He never helped the people.

237
00:25:01,605 --> 00:25:05,625
All you care about is keeping your places.

238
00:25:07,245 --> 00:25:17,245
It's hyperbole for a man who confiscates the property of
a Bey because he thought differently than he did.

239
00:25:20,105 --> 00:25:23,345
Karacahisar and Kulucahisar.

240
00:25:24,335 --> 00:25:26,035
And even Bilecik Castle.

241
00:25:31,085 --> 00:25:34,275
You will hand these
castles over to me.

242
00:25:49,195 --> 00:25:52,585
All trade documents of these castles will
remain with Byzantium.

243
00:25:53,485 --> 00:25:56,165
And the caravans will operate with
Constantinople.

244
00:25:56,735 --> 00:25:58,965
The same applies to
Söğüt and Yenişehir.

245
00:26:00,195 --> 00:26:03,865
Basically, you will have nothing else left
after signing the agreement.

246
00:26:14,475 --> 00:26:16,525
The lands I took with blood...

247
00:26:21,895 --> 00:26:24,425
You ask me to submit them on paper.

248
00:26:32,175 --> 00:26:36,215
You want me to give you the places that
lie like hammers on the enemy's chest.

249
00:26:39,155 --> 00:26:41,665
And you want me to agree
and be grateful for that.

250
00:26:46,535 --> 00:26:47,835
No.

251
00:26:49,545 --> 00:26:53,105
We have clarified our terms for the
agreement in the best way.

252
00:26:53,455 --> 00:26:54,955
Osman Bey.

253
00:26:55,525 --> 00:27:00,465
10,000 horsemen are
ready to enter Yenişehir.

254
00:27:01,935 --> 00:27:03,815
They are waiting for your decision.

255
00:27:05,245 --> 00:27:07,265
Don't force me to.

256
00:27:08,855 --> 00:27:12,935
A thousand cavalry and 5,000
foot soldiers await my order.

257
00:27:13,725 --> 00:27:16,505
We are here for peace, Osman Bey.

258
00:27:17,565 --> 00:27:19,455
Please, do not shed blood.

259
00:27:38,255 --> 00:27:40,055
I do not wish for bloodshed.

260
00:28:07,085 --> 00:28:08,925
I don't feed on blood.

261
00:28:11,805 --> 00:28:13,105
However...

262
00:28:15,725 --> 00:28:18,285
If you wish to expel me from my country...

263
00:28:37,345 --> 00:28:39,465
Then I will not leave my country
to anyone.

264
00:28:46,705 --> 00:28:48,485
If I'm not there...

265
00:28:49,365 --> 00:28:51,905
This will be the end of your
agreement as well.

266
00:29:12,835 --> 00:29:15,015
I will inform you of my
decision tomorrow.

267
00:29:57,375 --> 00:29:58,875
Alçiçek.

268
00:30:22,315 --> 00:30:23,815
You are fine, right?

269
00:30:30,535 --> 00:30:32,355
If you do something to my daughter!

270
00:30:34,295 --> 00:30:36,595
I will burn you and your palace!

271
00:30:37,335 --> 00:30:41,485
You don't know me and you
haven't seen anything yet.

272
00:30:42,365 --> 00:30:43,865
Aktemur!

273
00:30:44,435 --> 00:30:46,965
I will burn you all!

274
00:30:47,225 --> 00:30:49,025
Watch your words, Hatun.

275
00:30:49,675 --> 00:30:51,685
Who would do anything to Alçiçek?

276
00:31:05,025 --> 00:31:06,865
I got so scared, Aktemur.

277
00:31:10,775 --> 00:31:12,475
I cried a lot.

278
00:31:17,065 --> 00:31:22,415
I thought you left me and
got scared and ran away.

279
00:31:41,195 --> 00:31:42,915
When I was coming to you...

280
00:31:46,985 --> 00:31:48,485
I fell into hell.

281
00:31:54,155 --> 00:32:01,655
That dog Olof said the girl
I love would marry Bayındır.

282
00:32:06,095 --> 00:32:07,795
I didn't believe it.

283
00:32:11,165 --> 00:32:12,665
But you...

284
00:32:15,505 --> 00:32:16,805
You are...

285
00:32:20,955 --> 00:32:28,235
You thought I got scared and
ran away and left you.

286
00:32:41,535 --> 00:32:43,235
You believed everything, however...

287
00:32:47,335 --> 00:32:49,225
You didn't believe my love for you.

288
00:32:53,145 --> 00:32:54,445
Now...

289
00:32:55,225 --> 00:32:57,105
Take off those earrings.

290
00:33:00,755 --> 00:33:03,325
Cry for Bayındır from now on.

291
00:33:35,995 --> 00:33:37,295
Father.

292
00:33:40,615 --> 00:33:43,665
- Let's go from here now.
- Let's go, daughter, let's go.

293
00:33:45,485 --> 00:33:46,845
Come on.

294
00:33:47,165 --> 00:33:48,965
This charade is over.

295
00:33:49,045 --> 00:33:51,595
You've gone too far, however...

296
00:33:51,985 --> 00:33:55,035
You know that my patience is running out.

297
00:33:56,415 --> 00:33:57,915
Come on, let's go.

298
00:34:44,225 --> 00:34:46,795
What's going on, Aktemur*

299
00:34:47,735 --> 00:34:49,574
Where did Alçiçek go?

300
00:34:49,685 --> 00:34:51,185
It's my decision.

301
00:34:52,665 --> 00:34:54,545
I told her to leave.

302
00:34:59,745 --> 00:35:03,285
Osman Bey has kidnapped the girl
from a wedding party held by the Sultan.

303
00:35:03,445 --> 00:35:05,325
And you told her to leave.

304
00:35:08,085 --> 00:35:09,675
Ayşe.

305
00:35:12,005 --> 00:35:14,815
What does this mean, Aktemur?

306
00:35:15,675 --> 00:35:17,495
How did you do this to Alçiçek?

307
00:35:20,215 --> 00:35:21,915
Forgive me for your sake.

308
00:35:24,005 --> 00:35:25,545
I tired you.

309
00:35:28,635 --> 00:35:29,935
However...

310
00:35:34,915 --> 00:35:36,965
I don't trust Alçiçek's love.

311
00:35:40,705 --> 00:35:42,495
She left me in the middle.

312
00:35:42,575 --> 00:35:46,085
Alçiçek that I loved....

313
00:35:49,745 --> 00:35:55,985
She would've done everything she could
and wouldn't have allowed that wedding.

314
00:36:00,255 --> 00:36:01,755
Aktemur.

315
00:36:03,575 --> 00:36:05,625
Do not insist on this matter anymore.

316
00:36:12,535 --> 00:36:14,115
Ayşe.

317
00:36:58,385 --> 00:37:01,475
I called you İltutan. (land-holder)

318
00:37:03,150 --> 00:37:05,660
So that we would hold all lands together.

319
00:37:05,680 --> 00:37:07,680
Near Yenişehir

320
00:37:07,950 --> 00:37:11,680
But now the people of strife unite...

321
00:37:12,680 --> 00:37:14,900
And they want what we have.

322
00:37:16,250 --> 00:37:19,990
Your feet would have trampled
many lands of the infidels.

323
00:37:20,860 --> 00:37:23,620
Now the infidels have united and
want our homeland.

324
00:37:40,620 --> 00:37:42,580
I do not carry this sword in vain.

325
00:37:43,810 --> 00:37:46,320
And I don't make you
wear armor in vain.

326
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,910
This will not be easy.

327
00:37:49,780 --> 00:37:54,200
What is taken by blood
is given by blood only.

328
00:37:59,580 --> 00:38:01,830
Not just our blood...

329
00:38:02,840 --> 00:38:05,760
Rather, they threaten us with the
blood of innocents.

330
00:38:06,140 --> 00:38:09,910
No, we will never give up.

331
00:38:10,040 --> 00:38:12,670
We will never give up.

332
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:14,790
We will never give up!

333
00:38:15,190 --> 00:38:16,530
Never.

334
00:38:21,870 --> 00:38:23,230
Well, what if...

335
00:38:27,220 --> 00:38:30,910
I'm reluctant to hand it over
so they don't think I'm afraid.

336
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:33,550
No.

337
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,860
I'm not even afraid of fear.

338
00:38:36,830 --> 00:38:39,040
They can think whatever they wish.

339
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:43,960
If I don't accept...

340
00:38:45,430 --> 00:38:47,860
Then we will be crushed
between the two states.

341
00:38:49,200 --> 00:38:51,980
The dream of the country we
dreamed of will disappear forever.

342
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:55,310
However...

343
00:38:57,570 --> 00:38:59,320
If I give the castles...

344
00:39:01,730 --> 00:39:03,830
I will have a chance in
another campaign.

345
00:39:04,950 --> 00:39:08,520
Those who think about their own souls
have been holding back for a while.

346
00:39:08,930 --> 00:39:10,650
As for those who are behind us...

347
00:39:12,720 --> 00:39:14,780
They gave up their lives.

348
00:39:16,710 --> 00:39:20,130
Well, what about...

349
00:39:24,680 --> 00:39:27,230
What if the dreams of those
behind me are shattered?

350
00:39:30,040 --> 00:39:32,420
What will...

351
00:39:33,500 --> 00:39:34,960
What will happen then?

352
00:39:36,150 --> 00:39:37,180
No.

353
00:39:40,150 --> 00:39:42,120
Think, Osman.

354
00:39:42,780 --> 00:39:46,390
Osman.

355
00:39:49,290 --> 00:39:52,500
But I'm at a point where I can't find
a solution through thinking.

356
00:39:53,640 --> 00:39:54,880
No...

357
00:39:57,385 --> 00:39:58,895
My Allah.

358
00:40:01,745 --> 00:40:03,135
My Allah.

359
00:40:05,035 --> 00:40:08,095
My Allah, the owner of everything.

360
00:40:11,095 --> 00:40:16,325
Help this helpless servant of yours.

361
00:40:17,575 --> 00:40:19,335
Ahead is a fire.

362
00:40:21,095 --> 00:40:22,685
A flood is behind us.

363
00:40:23,685 --> 00:40:28,535
Have mercy on me, my Allah.

364
00:40:30,275 --> 00:40:32,795
You are the one who
knows everything.

365
00:40:33,075 --> 00:40:34,915
And you see it all.

366
00:40:35,945 --> 00:40:37,475
My Allah.

367
00:40:40,065 --> 00:40:42,645
Show me the way.

368
00:40:45,135 --> 00:40:47,675
Show me the way.

369
00:40:49,075 --> 00:40:50,605
Amin.

370
00:40:53,775 --> 00:40:55,345
Amin.

371
00:41:03,350 --> 00:41:05,790
There is no word from
Osman Bey yet, however...

372
00:41:05,830 --> 00:41:07,650
we better be careful.

373
00:41:20,550 --> 00:41:22,130
Ayşe.

374
00:41:23,860 --> 00:41:26,360
Are you thinking about what Aktemur did?

375
00:41:27,300 --> 00:41:30,160
He even risked being up against me, Bala.

376
00:41:31,410 --> 00:41:35,580
Despite all your efforts, he says
he doesn't want her.

377
00:41:36,380 --> 00:41:39,800
Actually, I'm thinking about what
we're going to say to Osman Bey

378
00:41:40,720 --> 00:41:43,230
If he doesn't want to,
what will he do, Ayşe?

379
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:45,630
They shouldn't be unhappy
because we made efforts.

380
00:41:45,860 --> 00:41:49,910
They shouldn't be unhappy
because of Osman Bey.

381
00:41:50,900 --> 00:41:54,450
Let's say
this is good for us.

382
00:41:54,780 --> 00:41:56,540
It's true what you say.

383
00:41:57,850 --> 00:42:00,710
May Osman Bey come safely.

384
00:42:00,840 --> 00:42:02,380
And he brings us good news.

385
00:42:03,310 --> 00:42:05,850
I will talk to him about this in detail.

386
00:42:06,700 --> 00:42:08,250
Inshallah.

387
00:42:23,490 --> 00:42:25,300
Will you allow me?

388
00:42:29,370 --> 00:42:31,190
I brought you news.

389
00:42:31,340 --> 00:42:33,160
But it is not good news.

390
00:42:38,620 --> 00:42:42,240
Kantakuzenos and İsmihan unite.

391
00:42:42,710 --> 00:42:45,800
They both want castles.

392
00:42:48,370 --> 00:42:50,240
What are you saying, Şamil?

393
00:42:51,150 --> 00:42:53,020
What does
Osman Bey say about this?

394
00:42:53,050 --> 00:42:54,310
I don't know.

395
00:42:54,370 --> 00:42:55,740
What do they trust?

396
00:42:55,780 --> 00:42:57,790
They have an army.

397
00:42:58,020 --> 00:43:02,450
They're talking about thousands of
soldiers and cavalry, Malhun Hatun.

398
00:43:12,800 --> 00:43:15,440
Aktemur! Alps!

399
00:43:17,200 --> 00:43:19,370
Aktemur, arm the Alps.

400
00:43:19,470 --> 00:43:20,860
The situation is dangerous.

401
00:43:20,870 --> 00:43:22,950
Thousands of enemy
soldiers will attack us.

402
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:23,940
Your command.

403
00:43:23,960 --> 00:43:25,190
Not just Alps!

404
00:43:25,350 --> 00:43:27,580
Rather, merchants, students
and everyone else!

405
00:43:27,670 --> 00:43:29,710
Kutlu, go to madrasah quickly!

406
00:43:29,800 --> 00:43:31,330
Your command, my Bey.

407
00:43:31,960 --> 00:43:35,140
Ayşe, go to sisters
and get them ready.

408
00:43:40,680 --> 00:43:45,950
Dursun Fakı, tell all the dervishes
in and around Söğüt and Yenişehir.

409
00:43:46,180 --> 00:43:49,730
We are waiting for him to stand
behind us.

410
00:43:51,890 --> 00:43:55,890
Malhun, are we sure Osman Bey
will make the decision to go to war?

411
00:43:55,960 --> 00:43:57,810
Is the opposite possible, Bala?

412
00:43:58,750 --> 00:44:00,530
We will not hand it over to them.

413
00:44:00,590 --> 00:44:02,670
Osman's work is
incomprehensible to the mind.

414
00:44:02,960 --> 00:44:05,670
We don't want to hand it
over to them, however...

415
00:44:05,850 --> 00:44:07,240
Bala.

416
00:44:07,270 --> 00:44:09,330
Even those we counted
are few in number.

417
00:44:09,670 --> 00:44:11,680
They talk about thousands of soldiers.

418
00:44:15,240 --> 00:44:18,400
Şamil, tell Boran....

419
00:44:18,600 --> 00:44:20,620
to dig trenches near Yenişehir...

420
00:44:20,640 --> 00:44:22,360
and to strengthen the walls.

421
00:44:22,440 --> 00:44:25,450
Let's withdraw the Alps from Söğüt
to this side.

422
00:44:26,130 --> 00:44:28,670
We can't defend Söğüt
while İsmihan is there.

423
00:44:28,820 --> 00:44:30,610
Your command, Malhun Hatun.

424
00:44:30,670 --> 00:44:34,000
Come on, all Alps move!

425
00:44:37,680 --> 00:44:39,200
Bala.

426
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:42,580
We spent years
fighting back to back.

427
00:44:42,780 --> 00:44:45,570
Do you really give a chance
that we will surrender?

428
00:44:46,010 --> 00:44:48,760
Not surrender, but withdrawal.

429
00:44:49,120 --> 00:44:50,900
We will take back what we gave.

430
00:44:51,130 --> 00:44:54,540
But if we lose our lives by staying
between the two states until then...

431
00:44:54,750 --> 00:44:56,640
There will be nothing left to take.

432
00:44:58,740 --> 00:45:02,450
This property is taken by blood and
given by blood.

433
00:45:03,010 --> 00:45:04,840
That's it.

434
00:45:05,910 --> 00:45:08,100
But even if we back down...

435
00:45:08,880 --> 00:45:10,860
As responsible for the state...

436
00:45:11,280 --> 00:45:13,370
We must take our precautions.

437
00:45:13,550 --> 00:45:15,090
I can't take any chances.

438
00:45:17,640 --> 00:45:18,960
Good.

439
00:45:24,450 --> 00:45:27,610
Mother, I want to go to Karacahisar.

440
00:45:27,880 --> 00:45:30,310
I do not intend to hand over
my trust to anyone.

441
00:45:30,890 --> 00:45:32,740
Send word to Karacahisar...

442
00:45:32,910 --> 00:45:34,380
to double the measures.

443
00:45:34,530 --> 00:45:37,740
You better stay here
until your father comes.

444
00:45:42,550 --> 00:45:44,480
Shall we hand over the castles, mother?

445
00:45:45,660 --> 00:45:48,670
I can't say for sure what
your father's going to do, son.

446
00:45:49,090 --> 00:45:50,910
The enemy cannot be known.

447
00:45:51,070 --> 00:45:52,600
But do not worry.

448
00:45:52,830 --> 00:45:55,560
We have to get through this somehow.

449
00:45:55,630 --> 00:45:57,050
Don't bother.

450
00:45:57,160 --> 00:45:58,420
Okay, mother.

451
00:45:58,970 --> 00:46:02,150
I'll help them with the letters
they'll write to the dervishes.

452
00:46:02,580 --> 00:46:05,600
Dursun Fakı must send them soon.

453
00:46:05,860 --> 00:46:07,450
Well then, come on.

454
00:46:16,785 --> 00:46:23,285
The goal was to have a land since the
era of Süleyman Şah and Ertuğrul Ghazi.

455
00:46:23,655 --> 00:46:29,875
And now all these lands that we got are
being abandoned and retreated, right?

456
00:46:30,125 --> 00:46:32,705
Who said we are retreating?
From whom did you hear it?

457
00:46:33,105 --> 00:46:34,695
Look at this panic.

458
00:46:34,775 --> 00:46:36,325
Who will back down?

459
00:46:36,675 --> 00:46:39,015
You've been this way all these years.

460
00:46:39,095 --> 00:46:40,675
Did you see someone retreat?

461
00:46:40,695 --> 00:46:47,025
If not reverted, then the
headers will disappear.

462
00:46:47,675 --> 00:46:49,675
Will you remain immortal in this world?

463
00:46:49,805 --> 00:46:53,325
The old bull is not afraid of the axe.

464
00:46:55,125 --> 00:46:57,465
My fear is for you.

465
00:46:57,665 --> 00:46:59,975
Never worry for us.

466
00:47:00,735 --> 00:47:04,565
He who was born for war is
not afraid of martyrdom.

467
00:47:05,345 --> 00:47:06,695
We will walk.

468
00:47:08,785 --> 00:47:10,805
It's nice to say, Beys, but...

469
00:47:10,915 --> 00:47:12,255
Look...

470
00:47:12,935 --> 00:47:14,525
How many people are left?

471
00:47:14,535 --> 00:47:16,045
Turgut Bey is not here.

472
00:47:16,095 --> 00:47:17,235
Öktem Bey is not here

473
00:47:17,275 --> 00:47:18,805
Bayındır Bey is not here.

474
00:47:19,395 --> 00:47:22,975
The road exists, but there are
no men left to walk it.

475
00:47:23,855 --> 00:47:27,505
If there is a way to walk, there will be
men walking in it, Emirhan Bey.

476
00:47:28,185 --> 00:47:29,715
Don't you worry.

477
00:47:30,575 --> 00:47:33,355
You can't resist fate, Beys.

478
00:47:33,645 --> 00:47:37,165
We cannot ask
fate for help without making an effort.

479
00:47:40,005 --> 00:47:42,355
Where is Osman Bey, Alps?

480
00:47:42,915 --> 00:47:44,685
Osman Bey is coming.

481
00:47:57,395 --> 00:47:58,765
O Allah.

482
00:48:00,135 --> 00:48:03,305
Come to the court, what
I will say is important.

483
00:48:19,315 --> 00:48:21,985
Söğüt Headquarters

484
00:48:29,055 --> 00:48:31,185
The Sultan doesn't
trust Osman Bey.

485
00:48:32,105 --> 00:48:36,165
If he lines up all these soldiers
and makes Söğüt her headquarters...

486
00:48:37,025 --> 00:48:39,845
She thinks Osman Bey will not
hand over the castles to her.

487
00:48:39,875 --> 00:48:41,315
And what do you think, my Bey?

488
00:48:41,345 --> 00:48:43,765
In your opinion, will he
hand over the castles?

489
00:48:43,945 --> 00:48:45,525
We'll see, Kutan.

490
00:48:47,545 --> 00:48:48,915
We'll see.

491
00:48:52,935 --> 00:48:56,235
Stop, they don't
know what they're doing.

492
00:49:36,215 --> 00:49:41,105
You don't differentiate between
friend and foe yet.

493
00:49:42,815 --> 00:49:44,915
How will you protect me?

494
00:49:44,915 --> 00:49:48,405
How will you fight for me?

495
00:49:50,925 --> 00:49:54,035
You can't even be dogs
in front of my door.

496
00:49:55,565 --> 00:49:57,595
Cut their throats off now.

497
00:49:57,925 --> 00:50:01,795
Till worthy soldiers are found to
stand before my door...

498
00:50:04,025 --> 00:50:07,415
You will stand at my door, Avcı.

499
00:50:32,435 --> 00:50:34,135
Go ahead, Turgut Bey.

500
00:50:45,885 --> 00:50:54,515
The Court opened with the ninety-nine names of Allah,
who made us responsible for the invasion, not the victory.

501
00:50:54,565 --> 00:50:56,385
In the name of Allah the Merciful.

502
00:50:56,515 --> 00:50:59,215
In the name of Allah the Merciful.

503
00:51:01,555 --> 00:51:04,185
A Bey's court requires more.

504
00:51:04,975 --> 00:51:06,445
Open the doors.

505
00:51:06,665 --> 00:51:08,335
For everyone to hear.

506
00:51:09,025 --> 00:51:10,905
Summon everyone to come.

507
00:51:33,625 --> 00:51:35,635
First, before I speak...

508
00:51:36,595 --> 00:51:38,405
I want to listen to you.

509
00:51:39,265 --> 00:51:40,785
Go ahead.

510
00:51:41,475 --> 00:51:45,515
If you are at war, I am
behind you, Osman Bey.

511
00:51:46,435 --> 00:51:49,865
If you're going to hand over
the castles, I'm behind you too.

512
00:51:50,035 --> 00:51:52,115
This is not the time for opposition.

513
00:51:52,185 --> 00:51:53,295
My Bey.

514
00:51:53,425 --> 00:51:56,475
If we return to our tribes alive as
we went out to offer our souls...

515
00:51:56,485 --> 00:51:57,835
we can't explain ourselves.

516
00:51:58,095 --> 00:51:59,375
Say fight, let's fight.

517
00:51:59,425 --> 00:52:02,505
We suspected you in the past about
who is the right side.

518
00:52:03,465 --> 00:52:06,595
They want the property that was taken
by your sword, Osman Bey.

519
00:52:07,015 --> 00:52:08,335
You are the right side.

520
00:52:09,345 --> 00:52:10,935
We are behind you to death.

521
00:52:12,185 --> 00:52:13,945
I said goodbye to my wife.

522
00:52:14,865 --> 00:52:16,945
I asked permission from my children.

523
00:52:18,125 --> 00:52:21,195
My Alps are ready, I await your orders.

524
00:52:21,345 --> 00:52:23,365
The soul is entrusted to us, Osman Bey.

525
00:52:23,995 --> 00:52:26,735
If this is the time to hand over
that trust... (castle-lands)

526
00:52:29,135 --> 00:52:30,855
We will do that.

527
00:52:30,955 --> 00:52:35,155
My Bey, may Allah
grant us success.

528
00:52:36,145 --> 00:52:37,765
I keep your secrets, my Bey.

529
00:52:38,295 --> 00:52:40,945
I swore to walk with you to the grave.

530
00:52:41,765 --> 00:52:43,605
This is the time.

531
00:52:44,825 --> 00:52:47,115
This is my second life, my Bey.

532
00:52:48,815 --> 00:52:50,515
You gave me the first.

533
00:52:51,325 --> 00:52:54,585
And the second, let it be a sacrifice
for the sake of this cause.

534
00:52:56,115 --> 00:52:58,265
I have nothing to say, my Bey.

535
00:52:58,795 --> 00:53:01,045
You will see me on the battlefield.

536
00:53:02,285 --> 00:53:05,255
As long as brave people
like you are behind me...

537
00:53:05,865 --> 00:53:08,875
As long as knights like
you are on my side...

538
00:53:09,345 --> 00:53:12,025
Nobody can defeat me.

539
00:53:12,985 --> 00:53:16,425
Allah bless you, Mashallah.

540
00:53:18,815 --> 00:53:20,855
And now I will announce my decision.

541
00:53:23,985 --> 00:53:26,665
Osman does not have
enough soldiers and weapons.

542
00:53:27,185 --> 00:53:30,065
Trade routes are under our control.

543
00:53:31,275 --> 00:53:33,825
I mean, he can't come
out in front of us.

544
00:53:34,275 --> 00:53:36,035
If he does...

545
00:53:36,755 --> 00:53:38,465
He knows he will die.

546
00:53:39,815 --> 00:53:42,065
Beys and tribes are attached to me.

547
00:53:44,465 --> 00:53:46,225
Osman is looking for help.

548
00:53:46,725 --> 00:53:49,755
He can't find what he's looking
for, Kantakuzenos.

549
00:53:50,465 --> 00:53:53,745
Osman can't basically lift
all these burdens on his own.

550
00:53:55,645 --> 00:53:58,395
He has no other solution than
to hand over the castles.

551
00:54:07,185 --> 00:54:09,295
What do you think, Turgut Bey?

552
00:54:09,775 --> 00:54:11,695
Will Osman deliver the castles?

553
00:54:12,085 --> 00:54:17,515
Osman Bey, whom I know,
gives his life, his blood, and his head.

554
00:54:17,735 --> 00:54:19,215
But he does not
give his land.

555
00:54:19,255 --> 00:54:21,255
I mean, it won't be that easy.

556
00:54:26,475 --> 00:54:28,475
So, we'll take his soul first.

557
00:54:30,145 --> 00:54:32,315
Then we take the castles.

558
00:54:39,235 --> 00:54:42,555
But I have to see someone first.

559
00:54:50,505 --> 00:54:53,405
You are all wondering what
I am going to say.

560
00:54:55,485 --> 00:54:59,065
But know that my
decision is final.

561
00:55:02,785 --> 00:55:05,975
My properties, Karacahisar...

562
00:55:08,105 --> 00:55:09,455
Kulucahisar...

563
00:55:10,645 --> 00:55:12,455
and Bilecik Castle.

564
00:55:15,075 --> 00:55:25,575
I will hand them over to İsmihan Sultan.

565
00:55:38,605 --> 00:55:41,205
Dissolve all the units that met.

566
00:55:42,085 --> 00:55:44,105
Everyone can return to
their tribes.

567
00:55:44,485 --> 00:55:50,185
- Don't do it, my Bey.
- Don't do it, my Bey.

568
00:55:50,355 --> 00:55:52,575
Don't do this.

569
00:55:52,885 --> 00:55:55,805
Until today, you used to
say "your command."

570
00:55:58,235 --> 00:56:00,235
I command...

571
00:56:05,505 --> 00:56:07,005
and you obey.

572
00:56:13,385 --> 00:56:15,885
Send word to İsmihan Sultan.

573
00:56:16,145 --> 00:56:19,225
Envoys will be sent to castles
and fortresses.

574
00:56:20,265 --> 00:56:23,565
Alps will surrender
castles without resistance.

575
00:56:25,165 --> 00:56:29,735
Everyone will come to Yenişehir in batches
without provoking the Sultan.

576
00:56:32,915 --> 00:56:34,635
Your command, my Bey.

577
00:56:34,815 --> 00:56:36,835
The council is over.

578
00:56:38,665 --> 00:56:39,965
Come on.

579
00:57:00,185 --> 00:57:04,215
Osman Bey, you are the Bey of Kayı.

580
00:57:05,885 --> 00:57:10,135
How can you hand over the castles that were
watered with the blood of all those martyrs?

581
00:57:11,885 --> 00:57:17,085
Don't do this, father.

582
00:57:18,535 --> 00:57:21,115
All those Beys are behind you and they
say go ahead.

583
00:57:21,385 --> 00:57:23,115
Why do you stop, father?

584
00:57:27,085 --> 00:57:28,635
My sons.

585
00:57:32,865 --> 00:57:34,915
Everything has its time

586
00:57:38,115 --> 00:57:42,815
And when that time comes, you
will understand me.

587
00:58:06,635 --> 00:58:09,135
I did not expect such a decision
to be issued, Beys.

588
00:58:09,935 --> 00:58:13,015
We risked our lives, but he
didn't, did he, Beys?

589
00:58:13,485 --> 00:58:15,985
Osman Bey was unable to risk his life.

590
00:58:16,035 --> 00:58:19,665
He is only afraid for you, not
for himself.

591
00:58:20,435 --> 00:58:22,615
Do not wrong him.

592
00:58:22,665 --> 00:58:24,855
Is thinking about my
life one of his tasks?

593
00:58:25,415 --> 00:58:27,955
Sultan İsmihan is right
in what she is doing, Beys.

594
00:58:29,815 --> 00:58:32,535
How could he surrender
the castles without bloodshed?

595
00:58:33,835 --> 00:58:35,015
He deserves it.

596
00:58:35,435 --> 00:58:38,715
It's true what you say.
He left us halfway through.

597
00:58:38,715 --> 00:58:42,015
It turns out that Turgut Bey and
those with him chose the right side.

598
00:58:42,405 --> 00:58:44,905
We were mistaken again, Beys.

599
00:58:45,015 --> 00:58:47,515
No sense in wasting time here anymore.

600
00:58:48,255 --> 00:58:50,675
Come on, everyone go to
their tribe.

601
00:59:30,685 --> 00:59:33,235
Oh, Bayındır.

602
00:59:34,585 --> 00:59:37,915
Look at the state you are in.

603
00:59:39,635 --> 00:59:41,015
My Bey.

604
00:59:43,885 --> 00:59:45,235
My Bey.

605
00:59:45,835 --> 00:59:47,615
I have good news for you.

606
00:59:47,935 --> 00:59:49,715
Alçiçek Hatun.

607
00:59:53,115 --> 00:59:55,185
Is this something said publicly?

608
00:59:55,735 --> 00:59:58,035
Speak, let us see, what is this news?

609
00:59:58,185 --> 00:59:59,955
Alçiçek Hatun.

610
01:00:00,335 --> 01:00:02,045
Don't make me lose my mind, talk.

611
01:00:02,095 --> 01:00:04,795
My Bey, Alçiçek Hatun is back home.

612
01:00:04,915 --> 01:00:09,285
When Öktem Bey went to get her, Alçiçek
Hatun was getting ready to go home.

613
01:00:09,395 --> 01:00:12,165
What are you....

614
01:00:13,815 --> 01:00:15,885
What could have happened?

615
01:00:16,935 --> 01:00:20,215
My Bey, I have another news yet.

616
01:00:20,215 --> 01:00:23,115
Could there be a
greater good news than this, Hüseyin?

617
01:00:24,235 --> 01:00:27,305
I heard this from the Beys coming out
of the feast, my Bey.

618
01:00:27,545 --> 01:00:30,595
Osman Bey will give the castles back.

619
01:00:32,785 --> 01:00:35,665
Osman Bey!

620
01:00:38,965 --> 01:00:45,515
You were trying to oppose people.

621
01:00:47,865 --> 01:00:52,865
Now, you will see what will
become of your Beyhood.

622
01:01:04,985 --> 01:01:08,405
As long as you love me, why
don't you talk?

623
01:01:08,515 --> 01:01:10,385
Are you talking to me, Ülgen Hatun?

624
01:01:10,435 --> 01:01:12,435
What? What? No.

625
01:01:16,535 --> 01:01:18,565
Do I know what I'm saying?

626
01:01:19,615 --> 01:01:21,465
Wait.

627
01:01:22,315 --> 01:01:24,115
I will ask you a question.

628
01:01:25,315 --> 01:01:30,115
There is a girl, this girl
is from our tribe.

629
01:01:30,315 --> 01:01:33,385
And this girl has love someone, okay?

630
01:01:33,735 --> 01:01:38,735
This girl heard the young
man talking to himself.

631
01:01:39,385 --> 01:01:44,665
The young man said that he
loved her.

632
01:01:44,885 --> 01:01:52,265
And I told the girl to wait and this guy
will soon confess his love to you.

633
01:01:52,385 --> 01:01:53,835
And did he?

634
01:01:54,885 --> 01:01:57,335
No, he didn't.

635
01:01:58,435 --> 01:02:00,635
He didn't say anything, damn it.

636
01:02:01,515 --> 01:02:04,635
But he's walking around the girl.

637
01:02:05,385 --> 01:02:10,845
But he does not look into her eyes
and tell her that he loves her.

638
01:02:10,995 --> 01:02:12,775
Maybe he's ashamed.

639
01:02:12,815 --> 01:02:14,685
What? Ashamed?

640
01:02:14,725 --> 01:02:17,345
For Allah's sake, why is he even ashamed?

641
01:02:17,465 --> 01:02:19,085
What is the point of being shy?

642
01:02:19,185 --> 01:02:20,965
Can he really be ashamed?

643
01:02:21,085 --> 01:02:23,085
Oh.

644
01:02:35,535 --> 01:02:37,035
May Allah facilitate your work.

645
01:02:37,435 --> 01:02:41,535
You go, do something, look at the shawl.

646
01:03:13,485 --> 01:03:20,265
I was going to east before
my Bey sent me on a mission, but...

647
01:03:27,765 --> 01:03:29,265
Enjoy it.

648
01:03:59,215 --> 01:04:01,065
Did she forgive me?

649
01:04:15,835 --> 01:04:17,195
Ülgen Hatun.

650
01:04:17,215 --> 01:04:18,965
Yes, Cerguday.

651
01:04:20,935 --> 01:04:25,485
Speak up, why are you
ashamed? Come on, speak.

652
01:04:28,085 --> 01:04:32,885
This is not enough for me, will she give
me more food if I ask for it?

653
01:04:33,535 --> 01:04:34,865
I...

654
01:04:38,535 --> 01:04:45,915
I want... to tell you something, however...

655
01:04:47,665 --> 01:04:49,835
Ülgen, girl..

656
01:04:51,865 --> 01:04:53,735
Yes, Cerguday?

657
01:04:55,215 --> 01:04:57,085
Speak.

658
01:04:58,165 --> 01:05:02,165
No, if I ask for more
food, she'll take what I have.

659
01:05:02,165 --> 01:05:04,715
It's enough food, Cerkutay.

660
01:05:07,635 --> 01:05:09,665
No, I wouldn't be able to say that.

661
01:05:13,585 --> 01:05:18,615
He couldn't say two words!

662
01:05:20,465 --> 01:05:22,315
If I wait for him...

663
01:05:22,715 --> 01:05:24,235
He hardly says it while
I'm in my grave!

664
01:05:25,235 --> 01:05:27,615
Oh, my fate!

665
01:05:33,185 --> 01:05:37,185
İsmihan Sultan, my Bey
has accepted the deal.

666
01:05:42,735 --> 01:05:51,755
He'll give the castles to you.
I came to tell you, we're out.

667
01:05:54,785 --> 01:05:58,835
I'm very glad that your Bey
found the right path.

668
01:05:59,485 --> 01:06:01,835
Send him my regards.

669
01:06:02,085 --> 01:06:05,635
This will be good for all of us.

670
01:06:46,585 --> 01:06:49,235
Where did the wrong path lead you?

671
01:06:51,655 --> 01:06:53,005
To me.

672
01:06:55,355 --> 01:06:59,155
You finally picked the right
side, didn't you, Beys?

673
01:07:00,255 --> 01:07:03,955
We have seen the truth, My Sultan,
and here we stand before you.

674
01:07:04,955 --> 01:07:07,435
Shall I punish you for being late?

675
01:07:08,535 --> 01:07:13,285
Or will I reward you for
coming in the end?

676
01:07:15,505 --> 01:07:18,155
Anything that pleases you, my Sultan.

677
01:07:28,705 --> 01:07:32,535
Osman Bey did not give you
your right at any time.

678
01:07:33,235 --> 01:07:35,755
I will prove to you that
I am the right side.

679
01:07:37,555 --> 01:07:41,435
I will give you the property
that I took from him.

680
01:07:44,685 --> 01:07:47,205
Excuse us, my Sultan, we don't deserve it.

681
01:07:48,155 --> 01:07:51,685
Why would I do something unjustly?
I'm not Osman Bey.

682
01:07:53,505 --> 01:07:54,855
Get up.

683
01:07:58,305 --> 01:08:02,435
Uraz Bey, Karacahisar
is yours from now on.

684
01:08:04,285 --> 01:08:09,705
Şahin Bey, Bilecik is yours from now on.

685
01:08:11,435 --> 01:08:18,685
Demirhan Bey, I am sure that you
will rule Kulucahisar with justice.

686
01:08:19,635 --> 01:08:21,185
May it be good.

687
01:08:22,335 --> 01:08:26,535
May Allah grant us to take proper
care of your faithfulness, my Sultan.

688
01:08:27,154 --> 01:08:28,685
May Allah bless you, my Sultan.

689
01:08:28,685 --> 01:08:31,305
May Allah protect you
and the state, my Sultan.

690
01:08:33,135 --> 01:08:37,234
Now go and settle in your castles.

691
01:08:39,555 --> 01:08:44,354
And never forget whose shadow
you're under.

692
01:08:45,734 --> 01:08:51,404
And if you forget, I will become
the sun and burn you.

693
01:09:31,385 --> 01:09:37,995
Salim Bey, you did a good job and
proved your loyalty.

694
01:09:38,395 --> 01:09:42,395
My loyalty is only to you, my Sultan.

695
01:09:42,805 --> 01:09:46,255
They basically pledged
allegiance to you in the arena.

696
01:09:47,604 --> 01:09:50,135
And now it's only official.

697
01:09:51,505 --> 01:09:56,805
If Osman Bey hadn't given up on the castles, their
stubbornness would not have been broken.

698
01:09:58,385 --> 01:10:00,705
This is our strength.

699
01:10:00,805 --> 01:10:02,305
Do not question.

700
01:10:02,755 --> 01:10:04,805
Do you have orders, my sultan?

701
01:10:06,585 --> 01:10:16,085
I want you to know the value of the high position
we conferred on you in Konya, Salem Bey.

702
01:10:16,305 --> 01:10:19,035
I am always at your command, my sultan.

703
01:10:36,155 --> 01:10:41,855
Osman is not someone who abandons
his castles and retreats.

704
01:10:42,655 --> 01:10:44,955
He must have a plan.

705
01:10:44,955 --> 01:10:46,955
Not this time.

706
01:10:47,755 --> 01:10:51,785
Osman was so cornered that
he had no other choice.

707
01:10:52,055 --> 01:10:56,055
Either he would be destroyed
or give up on the castles.

708
01:10:57,305 --> 01:11:01,835
However, I will be prepared
for any move he makes.

709
01:11:01,855 --> 01:11:06,035
And when I find the right opportunity,
I will kill him.

710
01:11:09,805 --> 01:11:12,555
I offer you an endless war, Olof.

711
01:11:13,135 --> 01:11:17,205
You can shed blood until there is no one
left to take revenge on earth.

712
01:11:17,805 --> 01:11:22,385
But you will need soldiers
and weapons for that.

713
01:11:22,905 --> 01:11:26,405
I'm now empowered
to provide this for you, you know that.

714
01:11:32,405 --> 01:11:33,785
I know.

715
01:11:39,645 --> 01:11:41,035
I know.

716
01:11:43,215 --> 01:11:46,225
That is why I am with you in this war.

717
01:11:47,435 --> 01:11:49,595
In order to shed the blood of Muslims...

718
01:11:50,865 --> 01:11:53,525
...I decided to be a Christian.

719
01:11:57,925 --> 01:12:02,435
Your true birth will be after you get to
know Jesus Christ, Olof.

720
01:12:04,725 --> 01:12:07,265
I knew you would find the right way.

721
01:12:07,325 --> 01:12:09,875
For this reason, I brought
the priest with me.

722
01:12:52,725 --> 01:12:54,235
Olof.

723
01:12:54,265 --> 01:12:57,015
You buried your previous life by baptizing.

724
01:12:57,345 --> 01:12:59,085
And you have been
resurrected to your new life.

725
01:12:59,085 --> 01:13:00,955
May Jesus Christ bless you

726
01:13:27,465 --> 01:13:29,385
Life is strange.

727
01:13:30,385 --> 01:13:36,825
When I started my day,
my god was Odin.

728
01:13:37,125 --> 01:13:43,635
Now I will breathe for the sake of the
Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit.

729
01:13:44,565 --> 01:13:46,555
Our bonds have become very strong.

730
01:13:46,765 --> 01:13:49,715
We will expel the Muslims from
these lands together.

731
01:13:54,355 --> 01:13:56,025
Can I come in my Bey?

732
01:13:56,715 --> 01:13:57,975
Come in.

733
01:14:00,935 --> 01:14:03,495
Sir, we have handed over the castles to the gentlemen

734
01:14:09,525 --> 01:14:13,865
We sacrificed our blood to have these castles
.” (Karacahisar Castle

735
01:14:13,895 --> 01:14:16,265
Not only that, but we gave our lives

736
01:14:17,285 --> 01:14:19,465
We can't give up

737
01:14:20,135 --> 01:14:24,135
Ismahan thinks she has put
her loyal masters on those thrones

738
01:14:25,485 --> 01:14:28,035
But it was I who sent the gentlemen for her

739
01:14:28,035 --> 01:14:29,225
(Kolugahisar Castle)

740
01:14:29,225 --> 01:14:31,225
I told a game within a game

741
01:14:31,815 --> 01:14:34,695
And (Ismahan) swallowed this bait

742
01:14:34,695 --> 01:14:35,875
Bilecik Castle

743
01:14:35,895 --> 01:14:39,065
The ones whose heart beat for war
won't accept whatever you offer.

744
01:14:39,155 --> 01:14:43,345
You cannot deceive the ones whose
heart beat for the name of Allah.

745
01:14:45,445 --> 01:14:48,375
Beys who seemed loyal to Ismihan...

746
01:14:48,935 --> 01:14:52,465
...are actually loyal to us and our case.

747
01:14:53,285 --> 01:14:55,165
They are happy because they think...

748
01:14:55,165 --> 01:14:58,085
...they captured the castles and
assigned their men there.

749
01:14:59,945 --> 01:15:02,305
Castles are still Turks' home.

750
01:15:02,855 --> 01:15:05,155
Whatever the enemy does...

751
01:15:05,635 --> 01:15:07,495
...as long as my Beys are there...

752
01:15:07,905 --> 01:15:09,495
...the authority is ours.

753
01:15:14,025 --> 01:15:16,085
Ismihan Sultan
will not have enough.

754
01:15:16,665 --> 01:15:18,535
She will set her eyes on Yenisehir

755
01:15:18,585 --> 01:15:19,935
Certainly.

756
01:15:20,005 --> 01:15:21,835
She have turned the palace upside down

757
01:15:21,895 --> 01:15:25,445
This was not enough for her and now
she is setting her eyes on our lands.

758
01:15:28,405 --> 01:15:30,905
We know how to scratch those eye out.

759
01:15:32,805 --> 01:15:35,015
Everything has a time.

760
01:15:36,275 --> 01:15:38,085
They made their move.

761
01:15:38,995 --> 01:15:40,825
Now they think they have won.

762
01:15:42,465 --> 01:15:45,265
But we had already made our move.

763
01:15:47,625 --> 01:15:49,745
And with Allah's permission...

764
01:15:50,035 --> 01:15:52,085
We will be victorious, Inshallah.

765
01:15:52,085 --> 01:15:54,085
- Inshallah.
- Inshallah my Bey.

766
01:15:57,385 --> 01:15:59,705
What has to happen will happen.

767
01:16:03,015 --> 01:16:04,535
Come on, alps.

768
01:16:09,575 --> 01:16:12,165
Marmaracik Castle.

769
01:16:28,055 --> 01:16:29,585
Alcicek.

770
01:16:36,295 --> 01:16:37,825
Alps!

771
01:16:39,065 --> 01:16:40,585
Clear the yard.

772
01:16:47,840 --> 01:16:49,910
Are you still crying over
Subasi?

773
01:16:52,120 --> 01:16:54,500
You disgraced us to everyone
in your wedding.

774
01:16:54,500 --> 01:16:56,060
Wasn't that enough, daughter?

775
01:16:57,690 --> 01:16:59,570
Who am I talking to?

776
01:16:59,720 --> 01:17:01,590
Who am I talking to, Alcicek?

777
01:17:01,680 --> 01:17:03,850
Is this how you keep your promise?

778
01:17:04,040 --> 01:17:05,570
Hatun!

779
01:17:06,540 --> 01:17:08,100
Enough already.

780
01:17:08,730 --> 01:17:10,490
- Cut her some slack.
- Oktem Bey!

781
01:17:10,680 --> 01:17:12,690
This is not the right time
to talk about it!

782
01:17:12,690 --> 01:17:13,970
We are even late!

783
01:17:14,640 --> 01:17:18,200
The reason behind her walking all over us
is obvious!

784
01:17:18,740 --> 01:17:20,280
Look at my face!

785
01:17:20,290 --> 01:17:21,680
Mother!

786
01:17:22,520 --> 01:17:25,230
Would you like to see the grave you
placed your daughter in?

787
01:17:26,120 --> 01:17:27,230
Look and see.

788
01:17:28,280 --> 01:17:30,880
Enjoy watching your daughter's funeral!

789
01:17:32,170 --> 01:17:33,660
But know this...

790
01:17:34,510 --> 01:17:37,400
...you are the reason
behind everything happened yesterday.

791
01:17:38,140 --> 01:17:39,500
Bengu!

792
01:17:39,500 --> 01:17:41,030
Let her!

793
01:17:41,230 --> 01:17:42,990
Let her, father!

794
01:17:43,290 --> 01:17:44,590
Let her hit me.

795
01:17:45,470 --> 01:17:47,290
But a slap won't be enough for her.

796
01:17:50,380 --> 01:17:51,910
I should die.

797
01:17:52,780 --> 01:17:55,370
I should die so that we both find peace.

798
01:17:56,840 --> 01:17:59,340
If this doesn't satisfy you...

799
01:18:01,550 --> 01:18:03,090
...hold the dagger you!

800
01:18:04,920 --> 01:18:07,500
This must be the only way you relieve!

801
01:18:11,580 --> 01:18:16,650
I died the day you tricked me to
go back and give up on Aktemur, mother!

802
01:18:18,140 --> 01:18:20,000
Kill me again, mother!

803
01:18:20,110 --> 01:18:21,500
Kill me!

804
01:18:25,340 --> 01:18:26,920
Bengi!

805
01:18:27,850 --> 01:18:29,220
Don't you dare!

806
01:18:30,120 --> 01:18:31,630
Oktem Bey!

807
01:18:32,120 --> 01:18:34,350
Never raise your hand to me again...

808
01:18:34,350 --> 01:18:36,550
...just because I did
what you couldn't do.

809
01:18:36,550 --> 01:18:40,810
Or you will regret it because
you have no idea what I would do.

810
01:18:42,030 --> 01:18:43,600
It's enough.

811
01:18:43,740 --> 01:18:45,260
Enough.

812
01:18:51,370 --> 01:18:53,960
Oktem Bey!
Bayindir Bey is coming!

813
01:18:59,850 --> 01:19:01,150
Let him.

814
01:19:03,580 --> 01:19:05,330
Stand up, daughter.

815
01:19:14,085 --> 01:19:15,915
No bird will fly!

816
01:19:16,315 --> 01:19:18,075
I don't want a mistake!

817
01:19:18,075 --> 01:19:19,585
Your command, my Bey!

818
01:19:23,845 --> 01:19:25,355
Aktemur!

819
01:19:33,815 --> 01:19:35,385
Good for you.

820
01:19:35,385 --> 01:19:37,385
You have boosted the precautions.

821
01:19:38,725 --> 01:19:40,615
However, you tire yoursel up too much.

822
01:19:41,185 --> 01:19:42,715
Get some rest.

823
01:19:42,745 --> 01:19:44,615
How am I going to rest, mother?

824
01:19:44,845 --> 01:19:46,435
It's my job.

825
01:19:46,515 --> 01:19:49,255
I neglected it for a long time
for no reason. It's enough.

826
01:19:49,255 --> 01:19:50,825
What do you mean for no reason?

827
01:19:53,895 --> 01:19:55,965
What do you mean by that, Aktemur?

828
01:19:56,205 --> 01:19:59,205
Didn't you fight me
all this time for that girl?

829
01:19:59,605 --> 01:20:01,645
Didn't you say you fell in love?

830
01:20:04,985 --> 01:20:08,055
All the obstacles are removed,
your uncle asked for the girl.

831
01:20:08,055 --> 01:20:10,635
What happened now?
Have you lost you interest?

832
01:20:10,635 --> 01:20:12,145
Mother!

833
01:20:13,685 --> 01:20:15,505
Alcicek is the one...

834
01:20:15,645 --> 01:20:19,075
...who gave up on me in the first problem.
She didn't believe in my love.

835
01:20:19,245 --> 01:20:21,765
- But son...
- There is no but mother.

836
01:20:22,885 --> 01:20:24,955
While I was fighting for my life for her...

837
01:20:25,055 --> 01:20:27,555
She was making her dowery ready
for Bayindir.

838
01:20:29,195 --> 01:20:30,935
It's over.

839
01:20:32,525 --> 01:20:34,615
Alcicek issue is done.

840
01:20:56,205 --> 01:20:57,765
Alps!

841
01:21:00,025 --> 01:21:03,085
Bring the gift boxes
of Bayindir Bey.

842
01:21:09,805 --> 01:21:11,885
What does this mean, Oktem Bey?

843
01:21:13,145 --> 01:21:15,925
I did not back out of this...

844
01:21:18,005 --> 01:21:20,345
...because of Osman's reckless behaviour.

845
01:21:23,835 --> 01:21:25,905
I still want Alcicek.

846
01:21:28,525 --> 01:21:30,275
Don't, Bayindir.

847
01:21:30,725 --> 01:21:32,275
Don't.

848
01:21:33,385 --> 01:21:36,055
Doesn't matter if you still want her.
I changed my mind.

849
01:21:37,645 --> 01:21:39,505
I will not give my daughter to you.

850
01:21:43,165 --> 01:21:44,805
What are you saying, Oktem Bey?

851
01:21:45,075 --> 01:21:46,635
Bengi Hatun.

852
01:21:46,655 --> 01:21:48,245
Do you have something to say?

853
01:21:48,315 --> 01:21:49,885
Bayindir Bey.

854
01:21:50,295 --> 01:21:52,115
Everything is still fresh.

855
01:21:52,215 --> 01:21:55,415
Allow us to think for a while.

856
01:21:56,955 --> 01:21:58,985
There is nothing to think about.

857
01:22:01,725 --> 01:22:05,035
You shall consider Alcicek
as your sister, Bayindir Bey.

858
01:22:14,725 --> 01:22:18,315
This wedding is not based on
our desires, Oktem Bey.

859
01:22:20,925 --> 01:22:25,785
I've considered Alcicek as a sister
for years.

860
01:22:25,785 --> 01:22:28,305
This is Ismihan Sultan's order.

861
01:22:28,825 --> 01:22:30,405
This is why we are here.

862
01:22:30,525 --> 01:22:32,055
We know this.

863
01:22:32,615 --> 01:22:35,415
Bayindir Bey, we know it.

864
01:22:36,165 --> 01:22:37,725
But he is a father, you know.

865
01:22:39,435 --> 01:22:42,025
Such an event shall not be decided in haste.

866
01:22:42,025 --> 01:22:43,365
Right, Oktem Bey?

867
01:22:43,365 --> 01:22:45,365
I said what I had to say.

868
01:22:49,915 --> 01:22:52,475
Let alone Ismihan Sultan...

869
01:22:53,175 --> 01:22:55,465
...even if the Caliph was here...

870
01:22:56,375 --> 01:22:58,525
I wouldn't give my daughter.

871
01:23:03,655 --> 01:23:06,985
The good visit is the short visit, Bayindir.

872
01:23:08,635 --> 01:23:11,685
Take your gifts and go on your way.

873
01:23:17,895 --> 01:23:21,205
And if Ismihan Sultan feels upset...

874
01:23:22,725 --> 01:23:25,735
...tell her what I said to you exactly.

875
01:23:26,085 --> 01:23:27,665
Bayindir.

876
01:23:31,675 --> 01:23:32,985
Good.

877
01:23:34,455 --> 01:23:36,245
Whatever you say.

878
01:23:43,015 --> 01:23:44,535
So be it.

879
01:23:49,765 --> 01:23:51,275
Huseyin!

880
01:23:54,475 --> 01:23:56,035
Alps.

881
01:24:07,365 --> 01:24:09,115
Thank you, father.

882
01:24:10,695 --> 01:24:12,785
I would die
if you gave me to him.

883
01:24:15,465 --> 01:24:17,465
I never want to hear such words.

884
01:24:18,195 --> 01:24:19,585
Agreed?

885
01:24:19,645 --> 01:24:22,415
From now on,
I won't do anything without your knowledge

886
01:25:19,740 --> 01:25:22,310
How is Osman now, Avci?

887
01:25:23,130 --> 01:25:26,270
He was crushed under your power,
my Sultan.

888
01:25:26,830 --> 01:25:28,710
He must be perished.

889
01:25:28,810 --> 01:25:32,030
I have taken his castles and cut his breath.

890
01:25:32,920 --> 01:25:34,770
And when the time comes...

891
01:25:35,230 --> 01:25:37,230
....I will cut out his liver.

892
01:25:40,540 --> 01:25:42,120
But...

893
01:25:43,130 --> 01:25:44,670
Osman...

894
01:25:45,900 --> 01:25:47,270
He is injured.

895
01:25:48,420 --> 01:25:49,970
He won't stop.

896
01:25:53,750 --> 01:25:55,610
Send a messenger to Turgut.

897
01:25:56,970 --> 01:25:58,840
Let him come to me immediately.

898
01:25:59,540 --> 01:26:01,080
Avci.

899
01:26:03,900 --> 01:26:06,400
You will send a messenger to
one more person as well.

900
01:26:16,130 --> 01:26:18,720
Ismihan Sultan thinks that...

901
01:26:20,080 --> 01:26:24,400
...I'll hand the rights of all those
martyrs and Ghazis...

902
01:26:25,000 --> 01:26:27,530
...to her without fighting.

903
01:26:31,510 --> 01:26:33,320
Her thoughts will be her end.

904
01:26:35,470 --> 01:26:37,180
Everything has a date.

905
01:26:38,310 --> 01:26:40,020
When the time comes...

906
01:26:40,040 --> 01:26:41,910
...as it happens to every hypocrite...

907
01:26:43,940 --> 01:26:46,730
...the chain of truth will bring
her death.

908
01:26:49,460 --> 01:26:54,240
You have a lot of responsbility to take
in this way of truth, Beys.

909
01:26:58,150 --> 01:26:59,920
Your command, Osman Bey.

910
01:27:00,980 --> 01:27:02,510
Uraz Bey.

911
01:27:03,900 --> 01:27:06,160
The weakest point of Karacahisar Castle...

912
01:27:06,900 --> 01:27:08,780
...are the blind spots of walls.

913
01:27:10,290 --> 01:27:12,590
Enhance them like gates.

914
01:27:15,100 --> 01:27:16,670
Emirhan Bey.

915
01:27:17,420 --> 01:27:19,480
The weakest point of
Kulucahisar is...

916
01:27:20,220 --> 01:27:22,080
...the east gates.

917
01:27:23,640 --> 01:27:25,700
Fix them.

918
01:27:25,840 --> 01:27:27,370
Eyvallah(Yes) my Bey.

919
01:27:28,020 --> 01:27:29,600
Sahin Bey.

920
01:27:30,300 --> 01:27:32,350
Bilecik's weakest point is...

921
01:27:32,900 --> 01:27:34,690
...the north enterance

922
01:27:37,450 --> 01:27:39,980
Triple the number of archers there.

923
01:27:40,320 --> 01:27:41,850
As you command, my Bey.

924
01:27:42,470 --> 01:27:45,050
You won't make a move
without informing me.

925
01:27:45,110 --> 01:27:46,630
Eyvallah my Bey.

926
01:27:47,600 --> 01:27:50,140
Do not go easy on supplies.

927
01:27:51,170 --> 01:27:54,890
Because Ismihan Sultan
will cover the expenses.

928
01:27:59,470 --> 01:28:02,010
Distribute gold to our people abundandtly.

929
01:28:04,370 --> 01:28:06,710
She will throw a sprat to catch a mackere.

930
01:28:08,510 --> 01:28:10,390
As you say, my Bey.

931
01:28:12,120 --> 01:28:13,420
Let's go then.

932
01:28:16,490 --> 01:28:18,340
May our conquest be blessed.

933
01:28:18,860 --> 01:28:20,430
Eyvallah.

934
01:28:34,885 --> 01:28:37,754
Sogut.

935
01:29:09,650 --> 01:29:12,150
Which guest of yours are we waiting for...

936
01:29:12,210 --> 01:29:13,460
...Hadrat Sultan?

937
01:29:13,500 --> 01:29:16,000
Is it Osman Bey again?
Are we waiting for him?

938
01:29:17,690 --> 01:29:19,480
You are going to be more pissed off...

939
01:29:19,780 --> 01:29:22,490
...than seeing Osman Bey, Turgut Bey.

940
01:29:35,670 --> 01:29:37,720
Sit down, sit down, Turgut Bey.

941
01:29:39,200 --> 01:29:42,030
We are not used to recieving respect.

942
01:29:42,510 --> 01:29:43,850
Sit down.

943
01:29:44,670 --> 01:29:45,960
No.

944
01:29:46,830 --> 01:29:48,620
No, this won't work.

945
01:29:50,730 --> 01:29:53,280
I cannot accept this.

946
01:30:14,500 --> 01:30:16,240
In my presence.

947
01:30:17,240 --> 01:30:18,940
And without my permission.

948
01:30:23,940 --> 01:30:25,940
If you have one more move...

949
01:30:27,170 --> 01:30:29,260
...you will both lose you heads.

950
01:30:30,650 --> 01:30:32,480
With this ignoble...

951
01:30:34,750 --> 01:30:37,330
Instead of eating at the same table...

952
01:30:39,620 --> 01:30:41,340
Better cut off my head!

953
01:30:42,040 --> 01:30:44,050
Come to your senses, Turgut Bey.

954
01:30:45,450 --> 01:30:50,150
Olof is a Byzantine general under
Kantakuzenos' command.

955
01:30:52,590 --> 01:30:55,970
Like you being a commander under me.

956
01:30:56,570 --> 01:30:58,560
I demand to be removed from my position!

957
01:30:58,640 --> 01:31:00,720
Your demand has been rejected, Turgut Bey!

958
01:31:00,720 --> 01:31:02,450
So kill me and finish this!

959
01:31:11,690 --> 01:31:13,280
We don't have to do that.

960
01:31:17,090 --> 01:31:23,790
Because you are an intelligent man, who can
forget the past and look to the future.

961
01:31:50,550 --> 01:31:52,730
Mongols have destroyed everywhere!

962
01:31:57,240 --> 01:32:00,830
The people do not need war, but peace.

963
01:32:03,740 --> 01:32:05,690
And for that, we must unite.

964
01:32:12,690 --> 01:32:15,780
From now on, we'll move together.

965
01:32:17,100 --> 01:32:18,840
Osman won't stop.

966
01:32:19,750 --> 01:32:21,510
Turgut Bey.

967
01:32:23,520 --> 01:32:27,060
Olof has put his men in castles.

968
01:32:31,130 --> 01:32:33,840
Because the Beys we put in castles...

969
01:32:34,470 --> 01:32:36,240
...are still loyal to Osman

970
01:32:37,070 --> 01:32:38,780
He is going after his case.

971
01:32:39,630 --> 01:32:41,590
This is what Osman Bey needs to do.

972
01:32:44,660 --> 01:32:46,210
Osman won't stop.

973
01:32:46,210 --> 01:32:47,710
He won't.

974
01:32:48,090 --> 01:32:50,090
If we are to form a union...

975
01:32:51,670 --> 01:32:53,520
...we have to unite.

976
01:32:57,180 --> 01:33:00,990
I expect you to calm down and adapt.

977
01:33:01,590 --> 01:33:03,370
Turgut Bey.

978
01:33:06,640 --> 01:33:08,010
Calm down...

979
01:33:10,110 --> 01:33:11,420
...and adapt.

980
01:33:20,250 --> 01:33:22,790
Are you still alive, Sarkis?

981
01:33:24,310 --> 01:33:26,900
Who knows in what disguise
we'll see you next.

982
01:33:31,280 --> 01:33:35,840
Don't question the loyalty of my men, Olof.

983
01:33:37,390 --> 01:33:41,920
Or I will question your loyalty to
Kantakuzenos...

984
01:33:42,900 --> 01:33:45,460
...because you couldn't get the lands
you wanted from him and asked me.

985
01:33:52,240 --> 01:33:53,770
So what you are saying is...

986
01:33:55,940 --> 01:33:58,430
...that the reason behind we collaborate
with him...

987
01:34:00,370 --> 01:34:02,920
...is that Osman Bey still
rules the castles.

988
01:34:08,575 --> 01:34:11,144
Yenisehir Osman Bey's Palace.

989
01:34:24,700 --> 01:34:26,270
There we are.

990
01:34:28,585 --> 01:34:30,605
This is the hardest part of the meat.

991
01:34:33,265 --> 01:34:35,825
Hard to cook, hard to eat.

992
01:34:36,595 --> 01:34:38,685
Just like the Beys who leave.

993
01:34:41,255 --> 01:34:42,605
Cerkutay.

994
01:34:42,675 --> 01:34:44,975
Chop them up for the soup.

995
01:34:45,015 --> 01:34:46,565
As you command my Bey.

996
01:34:49,675 --> 01:34:51,265
O Allah.

997
01:34:58,565 --> 01:35:00,575
Do not eat it.
It's for the soup.

998
01:35:00,755 --> 01:35:03,725
Do you think I am a savage
to eat raw meat?

999
01:35:05,515 --> 01:35:07,425
You don't understand the taste.

1000
01:35:12,505 --> 01:35:15,355
In Osman Bey's kitchen,
alps should not talk too much.

1001
01:35:15,825 --> 01:35:17,155
Don't babble.

1002
01:35:17,685 --> 01:35:19,495
Boran, chop the onions up.

1003
01:35:19,495 --> 01:35:21,925
Make them thin enough
not to feel them while chewing.

1004
01:35:22,325 --> 01:35:23,595
Your command, my Bey.

1005
01:35:24,035 --> 01:35:27,295
I will cut them as thin as
I strike the infidels in their foreheads.

1006
01:35:33,795 --> 01:35:34,925
What is there?

1007
01:35:35,535 --> 01:35:36,955
Why do the Beys stand idly?

1008
01:35:37,815 --> 01:35:41,165
Is it because they are Beys
who don't want to get their hands dirty?

1009
01:35:41,775 --> 01:35:45,015
Come on, we've got a lot of work to do,
the meat takes a long time.

1010
01:35:45,015 --> 01:35:47,715
Check out the dough and the bread .
We will prepare food for all those people

1011
01:35:58,445 --> 01:36:00,625
- Aykut brother.
- Yes brother.

1012
01:36:00,815 --> 01:36:04,615
Let's call Beys on the dough
so that we can work on the meat.

1013
01:36:04,715 --> 01:36:06,535
Yes, you are right, my brother.

1014
01:36:07,325 --> 01:36:09,395
My Bey, come sit here.

1015
01:36:11,095 --> 01:36:12,815
I can see what you are doing.

1016
01:36:12,865 --> 01:36:15,415
You are trying to keep me busy
with the dough, right?

1017
01:36:20,855 --> 01:36:22,745
- Aktemur.
- My Bey.

1018
01:36:24,015 --> 01:36:25,595
Come here will you?

1019
01:36:27,275 --> 01:36:28,825
Come here, come.

1020
01:36:28,915 --> 01:36:30,445
Take this meat.

1021
01:36:33,345 --> 01:36:34,895
Take this too.

1022
01:36:35,135 --> 01:36:37,175
Separate the nerves from the meat.

1023
01:36:46,875 --> 01:36:48,965
Thinly my Bey said.

1024
01:36:52,905 --> 01:36:54,495
Praise be!

1025
01:36:56,325 --> 01:36:59,415
We thought your skills are limited
with the swords, Osman Bey.

1026
01:36:59,735 --> 01:37:02,275
You are also skillful in the kitchen!

1027
01:37:02,925 --> 01:37:04,995
I don't like to talk about my skills.

1028
01:37:08,075 --> 01:37:10,075
Now that we know you are a chief...

1029
01:37:10,505 --> 01:37:13,595
We hope to see you valiants
in the kitchen more.

1030
01:37:14,175 --> 01:37:16,265
Thank you, Hatuns, thank you.

1031
01:37:16,845 --> 01:37:18,875
- Good luck with it.
- Thank you.

1032
01:37:25,295 --> 01:37:27,515
While you think you are doing
something good...

1033
01:37:27,515 --> 01:37:29,385
...ladies crack jokes on your head.

1034
01:37:29,465 --> 01:37:31,535
Never forget this, Aktemur.

1035
01:37:33,485 --> 01:37:35,625
Cerkutay, why are you waiting?

1036
01:37:35,855 --> 01:37:38,435
- We are cooking for many!
- Yes my Bey.

1037
01:37:38,555 --> 01:37:40,335
Chop it thinly.

1038
01:37:42,395 --> 01:37:44,685
Look at Cerkutay.

1039
01:37:44,815 --> 01:37:47,355
He can't do anything.

1040
01:37:47,795 --> 01:37:50,385
He wasted it.

1041
01:37:50,845 --> 01:37:54,665
And they still give him double swords.

1042
01:37:55,815 --> 01:38:02,385
If I had known today was his rest day,
I would have cooked for Cerkutay.

1043
01:38:03,295 --> 01:38:06,455
I would have cooked very well.

1044
01:38:06,735 --> 01:38:10,225
I always do it when he is hungry though.

1045
01:38:17,765 --> 01:38:22,855
So tell me.
Why did you reject Alcicek?

1046
01:38:23,495 --> 01:38:26,345
Expectations, uncle.

1047
01:38:27,365 --> 01:38:29,855
She thought I would marry someone else.

1048
01:38:31,485 --> 01:38:34,115
But it was impossible for me
to marry someone else.

1049
01:38:34,415 --> 01:38:36,355
But she made it possible.

1050
01:38:36,635 --> 01:38:38,165
She lost me.

1051
01:38:38,595 --> 01:38:41,065
Let your heart guide you.

1052
01:38:41,315 --> 01:38:46,135
Bring the heart, Baysungur.
Cook it and let it spread joy on our table.

1053
01:38:51,075 --> 01:38:55,605
- Is the soup ready, Gurbuz?
- Soon to be, my Bey.

1054
01:39:05,405 --> 01:39:09,975
Olof's men have received
the castles from the Beys.

1055
01:39:15,235 --> 01:39:20,565
No bird will fly there
without our knowledge.

1056
01:39:21,965 --> 01:39:25,065
Strengthen the blind spots of the walls.

1057
01:39:25,245 --> 01:39:27,975
Send the blacksmiths there immediately.

1058
01:39:28,095 --> 01:39:32,245
- Increase the number of men on walls.
- Yes my Bey.

1059
01:39:45,055 --> 01:39:48,565
We have an agreement with Ismihan Sultan.

1060
01:40:01,255 --> 01:40:04,815
We will rule Karacahisar together
from now on, Uraz Bey.

1061
01:40:07,315 --> 01:40:09,355
I hope the best.

1062
01:40:10,165 --> 01:40:11,875
Yes.

1063
01:40:13,525 --> 01:40:16,715
We'll rule Bilecik together from now on.

1064
01:40:16,915 --> 01:40:18,775
Hope for the best.

1065
01:40:19,515 --> 01:40:23,305
The orders of the mother sultan are
upon us.

1066
01:40:23,535 --> 01:40:29,215
We'll be loyal to the agreement.
We'll rule Kulucahisar together.

1067
01:40:29,645 --> 01:40:31,475
Beys.

1068
01:40:31,635 --> 01:40:35,885
Osman wanted to sabotage our campaign.

1069
01:40:37,545 --> 01:40:42,455
And we prevented this thanks to Olof

1070
01:40:46,605 --> 01:40:50,835
We have only one condition
for this friendship.

1071
01:40:51,015 --> 01:40:55,775
The innocents will never be harmed,
will they, Olof?

1072
01:40:56,615 --> 01:41:02,825
I will protect the innocent
for as long as I live.

1073
01:41:03,995 --> 01:41:11,385
I swear on God and his son Jesus.

1074
01:41:17,115 --> 01:41:21,415
Are you satisfied now, Turgut Bey?

1075
01:41:21,905 --> 01:41:24,545
Would you still like to leave our table?

1076
01:41:24,705 --> 01:41:29,005
If Osman Bey's ruling is to
end over the castles...

1077
01:41:29,695 --> 01:41:32,875
...I am satisfied, Hadrat Mother Sultan.

1078
01:41:34,585 --> 01:41:36,795
So go ahead.

1079
01:41:55,315 --> 01:41:59,845
Don't count too much on
this Konur, standing next to you

1080
01:42:01,065 --> 01:42:04,195
He is the eye and ear of Osman Bey.

1081
01:42:11,045 --> 01:42:16,275
Praise be to Allah, Lord of the Worlds, who
seated us at this table safe and sound...

1082
01:42:16,275 --> 01:42:18,835
...and bestowed upon us many blessings.

1083
01:42:18,835 --> 01:42:20,625
- Amen.
- Amen.

1084
01:42:20,775 --> 01:42:29,205
I thank Allah, my Lord, for being here
with my family, brothers and tribe.

1085
01:42:29,205 --> 01:42:30,295
Amen.

1086
01:42:30,375 --> 01:42:31,925
- Amen.
- Amen.

1087
01:42:31,955 --> 01:42:33,175
Amen.

1088
01:42:33,255 --> 01:42:37,835
Come on then, in the name of Allah,
the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful

1089
01:43:12,695 --> 01:43:15,345
Thank you, Beys.

1090
01:43:19,775 --> 01:43:23,315
You turned the kitchen into a battlefield.

1091
01:43:24,665 --> 01:43:27,975
However, the food is delicious.

1092
01:43:28,615 --> 01:43:34,675
No, Alps will work together
and clean it, right?

1093
01:43:36,585 --> 01:43:40,815
- You will clean the kitchen right?
- Of course, your command.

1094
01:43:40,915 --> 01:43:43,285
Yes they will clean it.

1095
01:43:44,505 --> 01:43:47,105
Thank you valiants.

1096
01:43:47,295 --> 01:43:51,625
We expect the same in your own homes
in the future.

1097
01:43:51,705 --> 01:43:53,805
Do it also without a Bey's command.

1098
01:44:01,975 --> 01:44:05,485
They burned the meat and bulgur.

1099
01:44:06,965 --> 01:44:10,655
Don't let these people into the kitchen
again, Osman Bey.

1100
01:44:13,045 --> 01:44:15,365
What are you saying, Ulgen?

1101
01:44:15,925 --> 01:44:18,295
What can I say, my Bey?

1102
01:44:18,775 --> 01:44:20,355
I am saying that...

1103
01:44:20,485 --> 01:44:23,715
...our kitchen is too small for
this many people.

1104
01:44:24,385 --> 01:44:28,505
Should we have set the table outside?

1105
01:44:28,685 --> 01:44:32,815
The food gets delicious where it is cooked.
Here is good.

1106
01:44:35,735 --> 01:44:37,755
Can I come in my Bey?

1107
01:44:37,925 --> 01:44:39,835
Come.

1108
01:44:44,195 --> 01:44:47,805
There is news from the castles, my Bey.

1109
01:44:48,085 --> 01:44:52,745
Eyvallah, we'll talk,
sit down and eat something first.

1110
01:44:52,955 --> 01:44:56,395
They set a trap, my Bey.

1111
01:44:56,675 --> 01:45:01,735
Olof and his men settled in the castles.

1112
01:45:09,985 --> 01:45:12,485
Who is behind this?

1113
01:45:12,565 --> 01:45:16,355
Ismihan Sultan and Kantakuzenos.

1114
01:45:19,025 --> 01:45:21,705
They ordered shared ruling.

1115
01:45:40,595 --> 01:45:42,945
Clear my way!

1116
01:45:55,745 --> 01:46:00,185
Someday
when all this is over...

1117
01:46:00,355 --> 01:46:04,895
...I hope you won't bring Olof
at Inegol throne.

1118
01:46:07,255 --> 01:46:11,335
I don't trust them, Turgut Bey.

1119
01:46:11,695 --> 01:46:14,235
I trust you completely.

1120
01:46:14,725 --> 01:46:17,345
Confidence comes on top of everything.

1121
01:46:18,035 --> 01:46:22,285
One spark would be enough
to start a huge fire.

1122
01:46:22,485 --> 01:46:26,765
I am responsible for
extinguishing these sparks.

1123
01:46:27,225 --> 01:46:36,725
Just like how I deposed Mesut and enthroned
my son in order to revive the Seljuk dynasty...

1124
01:46:37,075 --> 01:46:44,285
I will depose Osman too.

1125
01:46:56,385 --> 01:46:58,745
You killed him, right?

1126
01:46:59,975 --> 01:47:06,365
We should be afraid of you,
Mother Sultan.

1127
01:47:07,385 --> 01:47:14,185
My son, the great Sultan, was merciful
and allowed him to live.

1128
01:47:14,535 --> 01:47:20,875
He is now a prisoner in his palace,
which he loved so much.

1129
01:47:24,695 --> 01:47:26,685
Praise be!

1130
01:49:22,955 --> 01:49:26,325
Inegol Castle.

1131
01:49:26,885 --> 01:49:28,665
What are you doing, Turgut?

1132
01:49:30,985 --> 01:49:32,845
After all this happened...

1133
01:49:35,315 --> 01:49:37,125
Who are you sitting with?

1134
01:49:41,225 --> 01:49:47,725
The wound caused by your brother makes you
sit with the enemy at the same table!

1135
01:49:49,525 --> 01:49:51,565
But where does this road lead?

1136
01:49:53,785 --> 01:49:55,495
What am I going to do?

1137
01:49:59,695 --> 01:50:02,275
What do you think you will do, Turgut Bey?

1138
01:50:10,295 --> 01:50:12,095
How long have you been here?

1139
01:50:15,375 --> 01:50:18,535
Welcome, I didn't notice you.
Welcome.

1140
01:50:21,365 --> 01:50:25,215
If you don't want to hear, you don't hear.
If you don't want to see, you don't see.

1141
01:50:30,895 --> 01:50:32,455
What is it?

1142
01:50:32,915 --> 01:50:34,785
The property you acquired...

1143
01:50:35,685 --> 01:50:38,925
The property which is your right...

1144
01:50:40,205 --> 01:50:42,515
Does it overwhelm you now?

1145
01:50:43,745 --> 01:50:47,585
I see that you will give advice again.

1146
01:50:49,845 --> 01:50:52,365
Why have you come, Kumral Abdal?

1147
01:51:05,025 --> 01:51:09,085
I came to see
if you pulled yourself together.

1148
01:51:20,755 --> 01:51:23,795
Why are we in this situation, Kumral Abdal?

1149
01:51:24,975 --> 01:51:27,825
You come and wound my heart constantly.

1150
01:51:29,525 --> 01:51:32,595
Have you ever gone to Osman Bey
and asked him?

1151
01:51:32,595 --> 01:51:34,595
Why are you in this situation?

1152
01:51:36,225 --> 01:51:38,535
Do you think he pulled himself together?

1153
01:51:39,105 --> 01:51:41,175
Or are your advices only to me?

1154
01:51:44,135 --> 01:51:46,145
O great world!

1155
01:51:47,615 --> 01:51:49,495
O high throne!

1156
01:51:53,695 --> 01:51:59,365
Men who wanted to spit
in each other's faces gathered together...

1157
01:52:01,985 --> 01:52:04,195
...while friends clash.

1158
01:52:06,665 --> 01:52:11,705
But no, you are not the only guilty
here, world.

1159
01:52:12,535 --> 01:52:19,605
Guilt is also yours, you ventured into
alliance with the enemy to punish your brother.

1160
01:52:21,255 --> 01:52:25,325
You are also guilty, who cooperate with the
enemy and throw your brother under the bus.

1161
01:52:25,325 --> 01:52:26,485
Kumral Abdal.

1162
01:52:28,145 --> 01:52:30,805
Your words are sharper than
the sword and cauterize the heart

1163
01:52:33,215 --> 01:52:35,935
But I will not lose my respect for you.

1164
01:52:37,465 --> 01:52:39,505
Get out of my way for now.

1165
01:52:40,085 --> 01:52:42,885
I, I will not listen to you.

1166
01:52:43,455 --> 01:52:45,615
Do not listen to me, Turgut Bey!

1167
01:52:46,445 --> 01:52:48,025
Who am I?

1168
01:52:50,345 --> 01:52:54,365
Your heart will show you the truth.

1169
01:52:56,125 --> 01:52:59,965
Your inner voice will convince you to
wear the dress of love.

1170
01:53:02,305 --> 01:53:03,845
Forget about me.

1171
01:53:04,945 --> 01:53:09,945
Silence your soul so that you can
hear yourself.

1172
01:53:13,015 --> 01:53:14,585
Later.

1173
01:54:27,895 --> 01:54:29,625
Come on, valiant.

1174
01:54:33,105 --> 01:54:35,805
- My Bey.
- Tell me.

1175
01:54:36,035 --> 01:54:39,325
What is this demon Hatun after?

1176
01:54:39,815 --> 01:54:41,855
They've got Olof's men stationed
in the castles, my Bey.

1177
01:54:41,855 --> 01:54:43,655
I know this.

1178
01:54:43,655 --> 01:54:46,205
Anything other than that?

1179
01:54:47,785 --> 01:54:49,815
What she did terrifies even the devil

1180
01:54:50,065 --> 01:54:53,645
Sultan Ismahan made Olof and Turgut Bey
sit at the same table.

1181
01:54:58,325 --> 01:54:59,825
Turgut.

1182
01:55:01,925 --> 01:55:04,945
How did your eyes become so blind that
you cooperate with the infidels?

1183
01:55:05,505 --> 01:55:06,885
How?

1184
01:55:07,825 --> 01:55:10,965
They claim that they united
for the sake of the stolen lands.

1185
01:55:10,965 --> 01:55:13,655
But they divide the unity that
we have established to be strong.

1186
01:55:15,385 --> 01:55:17,645
It all happened after
she enthroned her son.

1187
01:55:18,185 --> 01:55:21,655
Well, what about Sultan Masud?
Is there news about him?

1188
01:55:21,655 --> 01:55:25,485
Yes.
Ismihan Sultan keeps him in the palace.

1189
01:55:29,185 --> 01:55:30,765
Nice

1190
01:55:31,705 --> 01:55:33,265
Nice

1191
01:55:33,815 --> 01:55:35,665
We'll go to Konya then.

1192
01:55:37,505 --> 01:55:42,225
If we save Sultan Mesut, he will keep
Ismihan and Aladdin away from us.

1193
01:55:43,105 --> 01:55:46,445
God willing, we will
also pay this calamity for us, sir

1194
01:55:53,895 --> 01:55:55,615
They are here, my Bey.

1195
01:55:56,895 --> 01:56:00,125
You have another mission now.
You will go to Yenişehir.

1196
01:56:00,805 --> 01:56:05,595
Ismihan Sultan is going crazy.
Inform Malhun Hatun.

1197
01:56:06,615 --> 01:56:09,305
They shall take precautions against
Ismihan Sultan.

1198
01:56:09,815 --> 01:56:11,935
- As you command, my Bey.
- Eyvallah.

1199
01:56:11,935 --> 01:56:13,935
We will ruin their plans.

1200
01:56:20,195 --> 01:56:21,795
Ah Osman Bey.

1201
01:56:22,285 --> 01:56:28,045
You tell me I am selfish
but you don't leave your selfishness!

1202
01:56:28,425 --> 01:56:30,485
You backdoor us.

1203
01:56:31,475 --> 01:56:33,265
Ah brother, ah!

1204
01:56:34,785 --> 01:56:36,175
Come on.

1205
01:56:41,695 --> 01:56:43,725
Sogut.

1206
01:57:02,985 --> 01:57:05,575
You aree coming
from Constantinople, right?

1207
01:57:10,195 --> 01:57:13,195
There must be marvelously huge palaces.

1208
01:57:16,385 --> 01:57:19,945
Best of all, madam.

1209
01:57:21,835 --> 01:57:25,945
You will use your skills for me very soon.

1210
01:57:44,555 --> 01:57:47,785
My Sultan, there is news from Turgut Bey.

1211
01:57:47,785 --> 01:57:49,785
Konur and Osman Bey met.

1212
01:57:50,285 --> 01:57:55,175
Osman Bey is going to Konya
with his alps.

1213
01:57:59,055 --> 01:58:01,755
Send letter to Osman's palace.

1214
01:58:03,755 --> 01:58:05,335
I will visit them.

1215
01:58:10,645 --> 01:58:12,145
Marta.

1216
01:58:13,445 --> 01:58:16,305
Let's see that palace
before owning it.

1217
01:58:20,505 --> 01:58:22,005
Avci, wait.

1218
01:58:26,925 --> 01:58:28,445
Right now...

1219
01:58:29,595 --> 01:58:30,965
...you'll first...

1220
01:58:57,855 --> 01:58:59,855
Yenisehir Osman's Palace

1221
01:59:03,435 --> 01:59:04,955
Here, here!

1222
01:59:05,715 --> 01:59:07,985
Don't miss anything.

1223
01:59:09,025 --> 01:59:11,615
Ismihan Sultan is very noble.

1224
01:59:12,595 --> 01:59:17,615
She may not like the food.
Let's not give her any excuse.

1225
01:59:23,945 --> 01:59:26,465
Who doesn't like your food?

1226
01:59:33,755 --> 01:59:35,925
Was it you, Cerkutay?

1227
01:59:45,475 --> 01:59:46,995
Leave!

1228
01:59:47,445 --> 01:59:50,495
Who knows what she will find to criticize!

1229
01:59:50,495 --> 01:59:52,375
Get up, get up, get up!

1230
01:59:53,435 --> 01:59:55,465
Get up, come on!

1231
01:59:55,755 --> 01:59:58,255
- No one will realise one bite.
- No way, no!

1232
01:59:58,255 --> 02:00:00,255
No, go, leave!

1233
02:00:00,255 --> 02:00:02,835
But, Cerkutay...

1234
02:00:04,115 --> 02:00:07,025
I keep your share in the kitchen.

1235
02:00:07,985 --> 02:00:12,175
- Ulgen Hatun.
- You'll like it.

1236
02:00:14,705 --> 02:00:17,145
Hey! He did it again!
Damn!

1237
02:00:17,145 --> 02:00:20,005
I said his share is in the kitchen,
what more do you want?

1238
02:00:27,675 --> 02:00:28,865
Welcome.

1239
02:00:38,005 --> 02:00:40,715
This coming- is never a
good sign, however...

1240
02:00:40,895 --> 02:00:43,955
Our table is like a home for those
who come to us as a friend...

1241
02:00:43,955 --> 02:00:47,065
and our sword is sharp against those
who come to us as an enemy.

1242
02:00:47,935 --> 02:00:49,815
It is, however...

1243
02:00:50,835 --> 02:00:56,115
İsmihan Sultan, did she come alone?

1244
02:01:02,745 --> 02:01:04,785
İsmihan Sultan has come.

1245
02:01:12,985 --> 02:01:16,155
Attention everyone! Mother İsmihan Sultan!

1246
02:01:49,075 --> 02:01:50,835
Welcome.

1247
02:01:59,655 --> 02:02:01,425
Welcome.

1248
02:02:22,445 --> 02:02:26,295
Alps, we're going to Konya, come on.

1249
02:02:26,405 --> 02:02:27,965
Your command, my Bey.

1250
02:02:28,055 --> 02:02:29,425
Come on.

1251
02:03:11,585 --> 02:03:12,815
Tell me.

1252
02:03:12,890 --> 02:03:16,590
The thousand cavalry sent by Kazan
are on their way, Commander Samagar.

1253
02:03:17,720 --> 02:03:20,810
Cavalries!

1254
02:03:21,980 --> 02:03:24,570
They did not trample
these lands sufficiently.

1255
02:03:25,540 --> 02:03:31,220
Get your men ready, Konya Palace
will soon belong to its real owner.

1256
02:03:40,750 --> 02:03:44,310
These thousand knights will make
Samagar more powerful.

1257
02:03:47,510 --> 02:03:50,550
Commander Samagar, there is
news from İsmihan Sultan.

1258
02:03:57,000 --> 02:04:02,020
Osman, bey of Kayı tribe, is coming to Konya.
Prepare for him a proper reception, Samagar.

1259
02:04:04,720 --> 02:04:09,260
Osman, killing you is
written in my destiny.

1260
02:04:09,840 --> 02:04:11,410
Let him come.

1261
02:04:14,090 --> 02:04:16,630
Death will embrace him.

1262
02:04:31,305 --> 02:04:32,865
What do you think, Marta?

1263
02:04:34,105 --> 02:04:38,615
Can you turn
this old inn into a mansion?

1264
02:04:38,945 --> 02:04:41,635
It suffices to command
me to do so, my Sultan.

1265
02:04:52,575 --> 02:04:54,345
Enjoy it.

1266
02:05:13,765 --> 02:05:15,745
What is this?

1267
02:05:21,595 --> 02:05:23,495
How do you put
that in front of me?

1268
02:05:25,115 --> 02:05:26,635
You stupid.

1269
02:05:28,025 --> 02:05:30,125
- What did I do?
- Shut up!

1270
02:05:32,745 --> 02:05:34,535
Get out of here!

1271
02:05:42,255 --> 02:05:43,845
İsmihan Sultan.

1272
02:05:46,395 --> 02:05:47,985
What you are doing is wrong.

1273
02:05:48,485 --> 02:05:50,665
What did you find
wrong with this food?

1274
02:05:51,835 --> 02:05:54,705
Shame?

1275
02:05:56,795 --> 02:05:59,335
I am the Mother Sultan of Seljuqs.

1276
02:05:59,825 --> 02:06:01,965
How do you put food
like that in front of me?

1277
02:06:02,125 --> 02:06:05,975
You obviously have bad
taste, İsmihan Sultan.

1278
02:06:06,485 --> 02:06:09,475
There is no other reason
to fault this food.

1279
02:06:09,805 --> 02:06:15,635
Hatun, you have forgotten who the
woman in front of you is.

1280
02:06:18,075 --> 02:06:21,455
The price will be heavy if you want
to remember who I am.

1281
02:06:24,715 --> 02:06:30,825
We have a reputation of making others pay,
not our own, İsmihan Sultan.

1282
02:06:34,015 --> 02:06:37,585
What you did with that food is
disrespectful.

1283
02:06:37,805 --> 02:06:39,375
Don't.

1284
02:06:40,195 --> 02:06:44,365
After all, this food is man-made and
there may be something missing in it.

1285
02:06:44,735 --> 02:06:51,185
But we do not want this
matter to spoil our assembly.

1286
02:06:57,185 --> 02:07:00,035
You are right, Ayşe Hatun.

1287
02:07:01,805 --> 02:07:03,595
For your sake...

1288
02:07:10,065 --> 02:07:11,795
I will ignore this.

1289
02:07:12,475 --> 02:07:19,125
My Sultan, come to our inn tomorrow
and I will prepare a table for you.

1290
02:07:22,025 --> 02:07:25,865
Oh, Bengi Hatun.

1291
02:07:30,675 --> 02:07:32,965
The position you are in
here does not suit you

1292
02:07:39,445 --> 02:07:41,575
Your place is in Konya.

1293
02:07:45,815 --> 02:07:48,375
And I saw your skill on the wedding day.

1294
02:07:49,685 --> 02:07:54,955
But, of course, we experienced
some inconveniences.

1295
02:07:55,615 --> 02:07:57,625
Right, Hatuns?

1296
02:08:03,205 --> 02:08:05,185
If I had sat at this table...

1297
02:08:07,275 --> 02:08:10,125
This is for your own sake, my Sultan.

1298
02:08:12,545 --> 02:08:17,655
This Kayiı tribe has dishonored me
in front of all the Turkmens.

1299
02:08:21,895 --> 02:08:24,675
And now, they're talking bad about
my daughter.

1300
02:08:24,815 --> 02:08:28,125
Know your limit, Hatun.

1301
02:08:37,515 --> 02:08:40,855
You did what you did on your own.

1302
02:08:41,465 --> 02:08:43,595
- If you weren't the reason they...
- Me?

1303
02:08:45,545 --> 02:08:47,855
I am thinking about my daughter's future.

1304
02:08:48,885 --> 02:08:53,645
Bala Hatun, you kidnapped
my daughter on her wedding night.

1305
02:08:54,485 --> 02:08:57,885
Now, you are slandering her
like that was not enough, Malhun Hatun!

1306
02:08:57,995 --> 02:09:00,755
You don't think about
your daughter's future or anything!

1307
02:09:00,795 --> 02:09:04,845
If that were the case, you would have
opposed her marriage with Bayındır!

1308
02:09:04,885 --> 02:09:05,915
Shut up!

1309
02:09:07,245 --> 02:09:08,805
That is enough!

1310
02:09:18,155 --> 02:09:21,995
Konya Seljuq Palace

1311
02:09:40,650 --> 02:09:43,780
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

1312
02:09:44,330 --> 02:09:46,720
We want to meet Sultan Aladdin.

1313
02:10:17,550 --> 02:10:19,480
Watch out, brother.

1314
02:10:21,710 --> 02:10:25,940
This is the horse Sultan Aladdin
gifted to him.

1315
02:10:31,910 --> 02:10:34,320
Do not look at the truth
with suspicion, soldier.

1316
02:10:34,320 --> 02:10:37,280
Otherwise, I will blind your eyes.

1317
02:10:37,870 --> 02:10:41,580
I am the former judge of Konya,
Dursun Fikih.

1318
02:10:42,310 --> 02:10:46,020
And this is Osman Bey's son Aladdin Bey.

1319
02:10:46,760 --> 02:10:50,720
Do not let us use force.

1320
02:10:50,960 --> 02:10:52,970
Dursun Fikih, forgive us.

1321
02:10:53,000 --> 02:10:55,090
Welcome.
This way.

1322
02:10:55,640 --> 02:10:57,160
Come on, my Bey.

1323
02:11:04,130 --> 02:11:06,440
Dursun Fikih, you know the rules.

1324
02:11:06,630 --> 02:11:09,860
You cannot enter without
delivering your weapons.

1325
02:11:11,070 --> 02:11:14,980
Watch your words brother.
An alp never drops his weapon.

1326
02:11:15,320 --> 02:11:17,250
We cannot hand you our weapons.

1327
02:11:26,180 --> 02:11:28,180
We will abide by the rules.

1328
02:11:58,230 --> 02:12:00,000
This way my Bey.

1329
02:12:08,010 --> 02:12:09,740
We are behind you my Bey.

1330
02:13:03,800 --> 02:13:05,320
Hadrat Sultan.

1331
02:13:10,520 --> 02:13:12,370
Sultan Mesut.

1332
02:13:48,230 --> 02:13:50,760
Insolence runs in your veins!

1333
02:13:51,370 --> 02:13:53,930
I came here to teach you.

1334
02:13:55,930 --> 02:13:59,380
The appropriate thing to do is
that you visit Bengi Hatun.

1335
02:14:03,420 --> 02:14:09,080
However, she acted maturely
and came here with me.

1336
02:14:12,570 --> 02:14:17,660
Now you will apologize to
Bengi Hatun for what you have done.

1337
02:14:32,220 --> 02:14:33,800
Ismihan Sultan.

1338
02:14:35,700 --> 02:14:39,080
Do you hear what you're saying?

1339
02:14:41,910 --> 02:14:44,420
We didn't do wrong to anyone.

1340
02:14:44,980 --> 02:14:48,260
We went and asked for the girl
according to the tradition.

1341
02:14:49,510 --> 02:14:54,310
We kidnapped Alcicek so as not to
let her marry a man she doesn't love.

1342
02:14:56,460 --> 02:14:57,980
You are right.

1343
02:14:59,130 --> 02:15:01,180
You are right, Ayse Hatun.

1344
02:15:01,670 --> 02:15:03,000
You kidnapped the girl.

1345
02:15:04,090 --> 02:15:07,685
Instead of having a wedding and
taking her as your daughter-in-law...

1346
02:15:07,685 --> 02:15:09,965
you sent the girl back to
her father's house

1347
02:15:11,750 --> 02:15:14,810
Everyone is talking about this now.

1348
02:15:15,100 --> 02:15:18,100
This is the matter of a young lady!

1349
02:15:20,100 --> 02:15:21,940
This is no game!

1350
02:15:23,880 --> 02:15:26,740
Don't let me repeat myself and apologize!

1351
02:15:27,000 --> 02:15:29,320
We will not apologize to anyone,
Ismihan Sultan.

1352
02:15:29,590 --> 02:15:31,320
Your disrespect towards us is enough!

1353
02:15:33,780 --> 02:15:37,350
If you are a friend then eat your food
and thank us, then get up and go!

1354
02:15:37,510 --> 02:15:41,720
And if you are an enemy, then stop this
nonsense, draw your sword and face us!

1355
02:15:41,820 --> 02:15:44,630
Who do you think you are to
dismiss me from my property?

1356
02:15:48,920 --> 02:15:51,930
You will pack up and go back to your tents!

1357
02:15:52,200 --> 02:15:54,200
The palace is not for you!

1358
02:15:59,290 --> 02:16:03,380
From now on, this palace will be mine.

1359
02:16:06,500 --> 02:16:08,040
Marta!

1360
02:16:08,970 --> 02:16:11,990
You will turn this dump into a palace!

1361
02:16:12,820 --> 02:16:15,610
Whatever you say, my Sultan.

1362
02:16:16,170 --> 02:16:18,270
Have you set your eyes on the palace now?

1363
02:16:19,530 --> 02:16:22,010
Your visit shall end!

1364
02:16:23,510 --> 02:16:24,940
- Enough of you!
- Bala!

1365
02:16:25,610 --> 02:16:26,940
Bala!

1366
02:16:28,620 --> 02:16:30,150
Calm down Bala.

1367
02:16:30,920 --> 02:16:32,718
You limitless!

1368
02:16:33,820 --> 02:16:37,830
Mother Selcan used to say,
"Only a fool guest tries to host the real owner"

1369
02:16:37,889 --> 02:16:41,029
You think you own the property
and we are the guests.

1370
02:16:41,029 --> 02:16:42,849
Only our swords will talk now!

1371
02:16:43,799 --> 02:16:45,820
- Let go of me!
- Bala!

1372
02:16:57,980 --> 02:16:59,740
Here is your end, Osman!

1373
02:17:03,080 --> 02:17:07,030
Killing you is written in my destiny.

1374
02:17:11,080 --> 02:17:13,430
My end will not be at your hands.

1375
02:17:17,183 --> 02:17:20,183
- Where is Sultan Mesut?
- He has never been here.

1376
02:17:21,855 --> 02:17:26,445
This is not Mesut's, but your grave.

1377
02:17:41,365 --> 02:17:42,865
You!

1378
02:17:47,885 --> 02:17:49,455
You traitor!

1379
02:17:53,763 --> 02:17:55,575
Yes Osman Bey.

1380
02:17:56,495 --> 02:18:02,545
It's time for you to pay for
all the injustice you've done!

1381
02:18:04,843 --> 02:18:07,395
Are you the one
who will make me pay the price?

1382
02:18:08,465 --> 02:18:13,325
After you get the biggest hit
from those you underestimated...

1383
02:18:14,593 --> 02:18:17,155
...you won't be able to talk
like that again.

1384
02:18:17,155 --> 02:18:18,695
Wait!

1385
02:18:20,593 --> 02:18:22,365
He is our prey.

1386
02:18:29,965 --> 02:18:31,485
Attack!

1387
02:20:01,205 --> 02:20:06,855
After killing you,
your land will be under our rule.

1388
02:20:09,635 --> 02:20:15,705
I will descend upon
your country like black clouds!

1389
02:20:15,985 --> 02:20:18,565
I'll break your hand if you touch my ring!

1390
02:20:26,735 --> 02:20:29,825
The noose will be wrapped around your neck

1391
02:20:35,985 --> 02:20:38,835
Even if the noose wraps my neck,
I'm still a wolf!

1392
02:20:39,795 --> 02:20:41,375
But you...

1393
02:20:42,035 --> 02:20:44,605
You are only foxes even when you die.

1394
02:20:49,295 --> 02:20:51,665
Once I get up...

1395
02:20:52,735 --> 02:20:55,445
...I will make you all pay.

1396
02:21:02,465 --> 02:21:18,185
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries